  {"g3:082aaef1", "Hello, {01}!\\nIt's {02}.\\n\\nOh? You happen to be around\\n{03} right now?\\n\\nWould you like to battle now?\\nI'll wait for you! See you!", "Hello, {01}!\\nIt's {02}.\\n\\nOh? You happen to be around\\n{03} right now?\\n\\nWould you like to battle now?\\nI'll wait for you! See you!"},
  {"g3:082aaf69", "Hey there, {01}!\\nIt's me, {02}.\\n\\nOh, hey, are you near\\n{03} right now?\\n\\nHow would you like to battle with\\nme right now?\\n\\nI'm not losing again!\\nI'll be waiting! Catch you soon!", "Hey there, {01}!\\nIt's me, {02}.\\n\\nOh, hey, are you near\\n{03} right now?\\n\\nHow would you like to battle with\\nme right now?\\n\\nI'm not losing again!\\nI'll be waiting! Catch you soon!"},
  {"g3:082ab010", "Hey, {01}{05}.\\n{02} here.\\n\\nWhereabouts are you now?\\nHuh? {03}?\\n\\nWant to battle now?\\nI'll wait for you. See you!", "Hey, {01}{05}.\\n{02} here.\\n\\nWhereabouts are you now?\\nHuh? {03}?\\n\\nWant to battle now?\\nI'll wait for you. See you!"},
  {"g3:082ab076", "Hiya, {01}{05}!\\nIt's {02}.\\n\\nHow are things with you?\\n\\nYou're where now?\\n{03}?\\n\\nWell, how about we have a quick\\nrematch right away?\\n\\nI'll keep an eye out for you.\\nSee you soon!", "Hiya, {01}{05}!\\nÉ {02} aqui.\\n\\nBem... como vai você?\\n\\nVocê está onde agora?\\n{03}?\\n\\nBem, que tal ter uma rápida\\nrevanche imediatamente?\\n\\nEu vou fixar meus olhos\\nem você. Até logo!"},
  {"g3:082ab11a", "Hey, {01}{05}.\\n{02} here.\\n\\nHow are your POKéMON keeping?\\n\\nOh, is that right? You're around\\n{03}?\\n\\nWell, then, we'd better have\\na rematch.\\n\\nI can wait, sure.\\nSee you!", "Ei {01}{05}.\\nÉ {02}.\\n\\nComo vai seus POKéMON?\\n\\nOh, é mesmo? Você está perto\\nda {03}?\\n\\nBem, entÃo é melhor ter\\numa revanche.\\n\\nEu posso esperar, com certeza.\\nAté mais!"},
  {"g3:082ab1b4", "...Er, {01}{05}?\\n{02} here...\\n\\nOh, you happen to be around\\n{03}?\\n\\nThen, let's battle.\\nRight away, I mean.\\n\\nI'll show you my POKéMON.\\nI'll wait for you.", "...Er, {01}{05}?\\n{02} here...\\n\\nOh, you happen to be around\\n{03}?\\n\\nThen, let's battle.\\nRight away, I mean.\\n\\nI'll show you my POKéMON.\\nI'll wait for you."},
  {"g3:082ab23d", "Oh, {01}{05}, how do you do?\\nThis is {02} speaking.\\n\\nI hope you're doing well.\\nOh, you're near {03}.\\n\\nWould you like to have a battle\\nwith me, then?\\n\\nI'll wait for you.\\nSee you soon!", "Oh, {01}{05}, como vai?\\nAqui é {02}.\\n\\nEspero que você esteja indo bem.\\nOh, você está perto de {03}.\\n\\nGostaria de ter uma batalha\\ncomigo, entÃo?\\n\\nEu vou esperar por você.\\nAte logo!"},
  {"g3:082ab2e9", "Oh, {01}{05}, hi there!\\nThis is {02}!\\n\\nAre you keeping up?\\nOh, you're near {03}?\\n\\nOh, well, then don't you think we\\nshould battle?\\n\\nDon't keep me waiting too long!", "Oh, {01}{05}, como vai!\\nÉ {02}!\\n\\nPor onde andas?\\nOh, está perto da {03}?\\n\\nOh, entÃo, você nÃo acha que\\npodemos batalhar?\\n\\nEspero que venha!\\nFicarei te esperando..."},
  {"g3:082ab382", "Oh, {01}{05}, hello...\\nThis is {02}.\\n\\nHow are things with you?\\nOh, you're near {03}.\\n\\nWe should have a battle now, then.\\n\\nI'm ready and waiting.\\nBe quick!", "Oh, {01}{05}, olá... \\nÉ {02}.\\n\\nComo vai você?\\nOh, você está perto de {03}.\\n\\nHum...\\nDevemos ter uma batalha agora.\\n\\nEu estou pronto e esperando.\\nSeja rápido!"},
  {"g3:082ab410", "Ah, {01}{05}.\\nThis is {02}.\\n\\nAh, so where you are now is\\n{03}?\\n\\nWell, then, we just have to have\\na battle, don't you think?\\n\\nI'll wait around for you!\\nSee you real quick!", "Ah, {01}{05}.\\nThis is {02}.\\n\\nAh, so where you are now is\\n{03}?\\n\\nWell, then, we just have to have\\na battle, don't you think?\\n\\nI'll wait around for you!\\nSee you real quick!"},
  {"g3:082ab4b0", "Hello, {01}{05}.\\nIt's me, {02}.\\n\\nWhere might you be now?\\n\\n{03}?\\nThat's quite close by!\\n\\nWhat do you say we have a battle\\nnow?\\n\\nI can wait.\\nSee you!", "Alô, {01}{05}.\\nSou eu, {02}.\\n\\nOnde você está agora?\\n\\n{03}?\\nIsso é bem perto!\\n\\nO que você acha vamos uma\\nbatalha agora?\\n\\nEu posso esperar.\\nAté mais!"},
  {"g3:082ab538", "Ah, hello, {01}{05}!\\nThis is {02}!\\n\\nI hope you've been keeping well.\\nOh, you're near {03}?\\n\\nSince that's not very far away,\\ncome see me for a battle.\\n\\nI'll wait for you.\\nBye for now.", "Ah, hello, {01}{05}!\\nThis is {02}!\\n\\nI hope you've been keeping well.\\nOh, you're near {03}?\\n\\nSince that's not very far away,\\ncome see me for a battle.\\n\\nI'll wait for you.\\nBye for now."},
  {"g3:082ab5e4", "Oh, hi, {01}{05}.\\nThis is {02}.\\n\\nYou're what? ...{03}?\\nThat's very close.\\n\\nDon't you think we ought to have\\na battle?\\n\\nI'll be looking for you!\\nBye-bye!", "Oh, hi, {01}{05}.\\nThis is {02}.\\n\\nYou're what? ...{03}?\\nThat's very close.\\n\\nDon't you think we ought to have\\na battle?\\n\\nI'll be looking for you!\\nBye-bye!"},
  {"g3:082ab670", "Hi! {01}, hello!\\nThis is {02}.\\n\\nWant to have a battle with me?\\n\\nI'll be waiting for you around\\n{03}!", "Oi! {01}, olá!\\nAqui é {02}.\\n\\nQuer ter uma batalha comigo?\\n\\nEu ficarei esperando você perto\\nda {03}!"},
  {"g3:082ab6cd", "Hello, {01}!\\nIt's {02}.\\n\\nWould you like to have a battle\\nwith me again?\\n\\nYou can find me around\\n{03}. I'll be waiting!", "Olá, {01}!\\nÉ {02}.\\n\\nGostaria de ter uma batalha\\ncomigo de novo?\\n\\nVocê pode me encontrar perto\\nde {03}. Eu vou esperar!"},
  {"g3:082ab73c", "Hey there, {01}!\\nIt's me, {02}.\\n\\nMy POKéMON have grown a lot\\ntougher since last time.\\n\\nI want to see how strong they've\\nbecome with your POKéMON, {01}.\\n\\nSo, let's have a battle!\\n\\nI'll be waiting for you around\\n{03}.", "Hey there, {01}!\\nIt's me, {02}.\\n\\nMy POKéMON have grown a lot\\ntougher since last time.\\n\\nI want to see how strong they've\\nbecome with your POKéMON, {01}.\\n\\nSo, let's have a battle!\\n\\nI'll be waiting for you around\\n{03}."},
  {"g3:082ab808", "Hey, {01}{05}.\\n{02} here.\\n\\nHow are things with you?\\n\\nMy POKéMON have grown pretty\\ntough lately.\\n\\nHey, how would you like to have\\nanother battle with me?\\n\\nLet's meet up around\\n{03}, okay?", "Olá, {01}{05}.\\nÉ {02}.\\n\\nComo vai?\\n\\nMeus POKéMON ultimamente\\nestÃo crescidos e bem fortes.\\n\\nEi, você nÃo gostaria de ter\\noutra batalha comigo?\\n\\nVamos nos encontrar perto\\nde {03}, certo?"},
  {"g3:082ab8b7", "Hiya, {01}{05}!\\nIt's {02}.\\n\\nMy POKéMON are growing up in\\ndecent ways.\\n\\nI'd really like to have another\\nbattle with you.\\n\\nI'll keep an eye out for you around\\n{03}. See you soon!", "Hiya, {01}{05}!\\nIt's {02}.\\n\\nMy POKéMON are growing up in\\ndecent ways.\\n\\nI'd really like to have another\\nbattle with you.\\n\\nI'll keep an eye out for you around\\n{03}. See you soon!"},
  {"g3:082ab95d", "Hey, {01}{05}.\\n{02} here.\\n\\nI hope you're on top of things.\\n\\nI was thinking I'd like another\\nbattle with you. What do you say?\\n\\nIf you feel like a battle,\\ncome to {03}.\\n\\nSee you!", "Hey, {01}{05}.\\n{02} here.\\n\\nI hope you're on top of things.\\n\\nI was thinking I'd like another\\nbattle with you. What do you say?\\n\\nIf you feel like a battle,\\ncome to {03}.\\n\\nSee you!"},
  {"g3:082aba03", "...Er, {01}{05}?\\n{02} here...\\n\\nSo? Are your POKéMON growing?\\n\\nMine sure got stronger.\\nI'd like to show you.\\n\\nI'll be around {03}.\\nCome see me for a match.\\n\\nSee you around.", "...Er, {01}{05}?\\nÉ {02}...\\n\\nEntÃo? Seus POKéMON estÃo evoluindo?\\n\\nO meu ficou mais forte.\\nEu gostaria de te mostrar.\\n\\nEstou perto da {03}.\\nVenha para uma revanche.\\n\\nTchau!"},
  {"g3:082aba9f", "Oh, {01}{05}, how do you do?\\nThis is {02} speaking.\\n\\nI hope you're doing well.\\nMy POKéMON are very frisky.\\n\\nIf you're ever in the area, please\\ngive me a rematch.\\n\\nI'll be around {03}.\\nUntil then, good-bye!", "Oh, {01}{05}, como vai?\\nAqui é {02} falando.\\n\\nEspero que esteja bem.\\nMeu POKéMON estÃo muito fortes.\\n\\nSe você etiver por perto, por favor\\nvenha nos desafiar.\\n\\nVou estar perto do {03}.\\nAté entÃo, tchau!"},
  {"g3:082abb62", "Oh, {01}{05}, hi there!\\nThis is {02}!\\n\\nHow are your POKéMON doing?\\n\\nMy POKéMON keep getting better.\\nI'd like to show you, {01}{05}.\\n\\nI'm around {03} now,\\nso let's battle if you're close by.\\n\\nHope I see you soon!", "Oh, {01}{05}, hi there!\\nThis is {02}!\\n\\nHow are your POKéMON doing?\\n\\nMy POKéMON keep getting better.\\nI'd like to show you, {01}{05}.\\n\\nI'm around {03} now,\\nso let's battle if you're close by.\\n\\nHope I see you soon!"},
  {"g3:082abc26", "Oh, {01}{05}, hello...\\nThis is {02}.\\n\\nSo, how are things with you?\\n\\nMy POKéMON have grown much\\nstronger than before.\\n\\nI'd love another battle with you,\\n{01}{05}.\\n\\nI'll be around {03}.\\nCome see me if you're close.", "Oh, {01}{05}, oi...\\nÉ {02}.\\n\\nComo estÃo as coisas com você?\\n\\nBem, meu POKéMON evoluiu\\nestá mais forte do que antes.\\n\\nEu adoraria outra batalha com você,\\n{01}{05}.\\n\\nEu estarei por perto {03}.\\nVenha me ver aqui."},
  {"g3:082abce9", "Ah, {01}{05}.\\nThis is {02}.\\n\\nWhere might you be now?\\n\\nMy POKéMON are full of life.\\nThey appear to be looking forward\\n\\nto seeing your POKéMON, {01}{05}.\\n\\nI'm around {03} now.\\nI hope you'll seek us out.", "Ah, {01}{05}.\\nÉ {02}.\\n\\nOnde você estar agora?\\n\\nMeus POKéMON estÃo cheios de vida.\\nEles ficam olhando para a frente\\n\\nprocurando seus POKéMON, {01}{05}.\\n\\nEu estou perto da {03}.\\nEspero que nos procure."},
  {"g3:082abda2", "Hello, {01}{05}.\\nIt's me, {02}.\\n\\nI should tell you, my POKéMON have\\ngrown to be quite robust lately.\\n\\nI would like to see them in a battle\\nwith you, {01}{05}.\\n\\nWe'll be around {03}.\\nCome see us anytime!", "Olá, {01}{05}.\\nSou eu, {02}.\\n\\nDevolhe dizer, meu POKéMON tem\\ncrescido bastante é está forte.\\n\\nGostaria de vê-lo em uma batalha\\ncontra você, {01}{05}.\\n\\nEstaremos na {03}.\\nVenha nos ver a qualquer hora!"},
  {"g3:082abe5e", "Ah, hello, {01}{05}!\\nThis is {02}!\\n\\nAre your POKéMON keeping well?\\n\\nMy POKéMON have been so healthy,\\nthey don't look capable of losing!\\n\\nI would surely love to have another\\nbattle with you.\\n\\nIf you're near {03},\\ndo come see us.", "Ah, hello, {01}{05}!\\nThis is {02}!\\n\\nAre your POKéMON keeping well?\\n\\nMy POKéMON have been so healthy,\\nthey don't look capable of losing!\\n\\nI would surely love to have another\\nbattle with you.\\n\\nIf you're near {03},\\ndo come see us."},
  {"g3:082abf36", "Oh, hi, {01}{05}.\\nThis is {02}.\\n\\nKeeping well, I hope.\\n\\nOh, yes! My POKéMON are\\nmuch stronger than before.\\n\\nDon't you think we ought to have\\na battle, {01}{05}?\\n\\nWe'll be waiting for you around\\n{03}.\\n\\nCome see us anytime, okay?", "Oh, hi, {01}{05}.\\nThis is {02}.\\n\\nKeeping well, I hope.\\n\\nOh, yes! My POKéMON are\\nmuch stronger than before.\\n\\nDon't you think we ought to have\\na battle, {01}{05}?\\n\\nWe'll be waiting for you around\\n{03}.\\n\\nCome see us anytime, okay?"},
  {"g3:082ac009", "It's me, the mountain-loving\\n{02}!\\n\\nWell, since we met, have you grown\\nto appreciate the mountains more?\\n\\nI rarely see you in the mountains...\\n\\nNext time, we'll meet somewhere\\naround {03}.", "It's me, the mountain-loving\\n{02}!\\n\\nWell, since we met, have you grown\\nto appreciate the mountains more?\\n\\nI rarely see you in the mountains...\\n\\nNext time, we'll meet somewhere\\naround {03}."},
  {"g3:082ac0bd", "This is {02}.\\nHello.\\n\\nI was just telling a new TRAINER\\nabout you.\\n\\nI told her about a strong TRAINER\\nwho raises POKéMON with care.\\n\\nI hope you'll become a TRAINER\\nthat everyone will admire.\\n\\nI hope we meet again!", "Alô, É {02}.\\n\\nEstava dizendo do novo TREINADOR\\nque era você.\\n\\nContei sobre um TREINADOR forte que\\neleva seus POKéMON com carinho.\\n\\nEspero que se torne um TREINADOR\\nque todos vÃo admirar.\\n\\nEspero te ver novamente!"},
  {"g3:082ac18c", "Hello! It's {02}.\\n\\nI love where I am now.\\nIt's pleasant with sweet aromas!\\n\\nI think someone planted BERRIES,\\nand they burst into bloom.\\n\\nSee you again sometime!", "Oi, aqui é {02}.\\n\\nEu amo onde estou agora.\\nÉ agradável, com aromas doces!\\n\\nAchei FRUTO que alguém plantou,\\ne já está florindo bem.\\n\\nTe vejo outra vez algum dia!"},
  {"g3:082ac228", "Hello! Thirty years of exploration,\\n{02} at your service!\\n\\nIt seems that you're energetically\\ntraveling here and there.\\n\\nHave you discovered any new ruins?\\nPlease tell if you have!\\n\\nNow, if you'll excuse me,\\nI have ruins to explore.", "Olá! 30 anos de exploraçÃo,\\n{02} ao seu serviço!\\n\\nParece que está energeticamente\\nviajando aqui e ali.\\n\\nVocê já descobriu as novas ruÍnas?\\nPor favor, diga-me a verdade!\\n\\nAgora, se você me der licença,\\nTenho ruÍnas para explorar."},
  {"g3:082ac30c", "It's {02}!\\n\\nKnow what I'm doing today?\\nLooking at waves from the beach!\\n\\nSigh... The waves are all sparkly.\\nThe sea is the prettiest from here.\\n\\nI'm getting hungry, so bye-bye!", "É {02}!\\n\\nSabe o que eu estou fazendo hoje?\\nOlhando para as ondas da praia!\\n\\nAh... As ondas sÃo tÃo brilhantes.\\nO mar é mais bonito daqui.\\n\\nEstou ficando com fome, Tchauzinho!"},
  {"g3:082ac3b6", "Munch-chew...\\nOh, hi, it's {02}.\\n\\nI love eating on the beach.\\n\\nMy POKéMON and I have been doing\\ngreat. We're fully fueled!\\n\\nI'm going for a swim. Bye!", "Mmmm-Mmmm... \\nOh, olá, é {02}.\\n\\nEu amo comer na praia.\\n\\nMeu POKéMON e eu estamos ótimos.\\nEstamos totalmente cheios!\\n\\nEu vou dar um mergulho. Até logo!"},
  {"g3:082ac446", "Hello, this is {02}...\\n\\nI've grown a little jaded with this\\nwhole COOLTRAINER thing...\\n\\nEveryone thinks I'm a perfect\\nTRAINER, and that makes me try to\\n\\nlive up to that expectation.\\n\\nBut I guess that goes with being\\na COOLTRAINER.\\n\\nI'll just have to buckle down...\\nand grin and bear it.\\n\\nYou're the only person that I could\\nconfide in like this.\\n\\nBut when I see you next,\\ndon't worry, I won't whine!", "Olá, É {02}...\\n\\nEu cresci cansado com esta coisa      \\ntoda de BOM TREINADOR...\\n\\nTodos pensam que sou um perfeito\\nTREINADOR, e me faz tentar viver\\n\\nde acordo com essa expectativa.\\n\\nMas eu acho que nÃo serei\\num BOM TREINADOR.\\n\\nEu terei que abaixar a fivela...\\ne sorrir e aguentar.\\n\\nVocê é a única pessoa que\\neu podia confiar assim.\\n\\nMas quando eu te ver na próxima,\\nnÃo se preocupe, nÃo vou reclamar!"},
  {"g3:082ac5c7", "Yahoo, it's {02}!\\nHow do you do?\\n\\nI've been raising my POKéMON with\\nyou as the target.\\n\\nI don't intend to lose when we\\nbattle again.\\n\\nIsn't it great to have TRAINER\\nfriends? Let's meet again!", "Yahoo, é {02}!\\nComo vai?\\n\\nFui elevar meu POKéMON\\ntendo você como alvo.\\n\\nEu nÃo pretendo perder quando\\nbatalhar novamente.\\n\\nNÃo é ótimo ter um TREINADOR como\\namigo? Vamos nos ver novamente!"},
  {"g3:082ac682", "It's {02}...\\nRight now, behind you...\\n\\nWasn't there something...?\\n\\nThe power of the POKéMON that\\nsleep here at MT. PYRE...\\n\\nIt's telling me about you...\\n\\nYou should walk away quickly and\\nnever once look back...\\n\\nGiggle...\\nFarewell...", "É {02}...\\nEstou agora, atrás de você...\\n\\nNÃo tem nada aÍ...?\\n\\nO poder do POKéMON que\\ndorme aqui no MT. PIRA...\\n\\nEle me falou sobre você...\\n\\nVocê deveria se afastar rapidamente\\ne nunca olhar para trás...\\n\\nHe, he, he, he...\\nAdeus..."},
  {"g3:082ac755", "This is {02}.\\nHow do you do?\\n\\nIsn't it convenient that we can\\nchat like this at a distance?\\n\\nBefore, if I wanted to speak with\\nanyone, I had to have my father\\n\\ndrive me...\\n\\nI should be going now.\\nI'm glad we had this chat.", "Aqui é {02}.\\nComo vai você?\\n\\nNÃo é conveniente que nós podemos\\nconversar assim à distância?\\n\\nAntes, se eu queria falar com alguém,\\nmeu pai tinha que me levar...\\n\\nEu já vou agora.\\nAh...\\n\\nFico feliz que tivemos\\nesta conversa."},
  {"g3:082ac82c", "It's {02}!\\nWill you listen to this?\\n\\nI like the SAFARI ZONE a lot,\\nbut whenever I go, I get lost!\\n\\nAll that tall grass!\\nAnd it's much too spread out!\\n\\nI feel better getting that off\\nmy chest!\\n\\nI'm off to the SAFARI ZONE again!\\nCatch you!", "É {02} aqui!\\nVocê tem que ouvir isso?\\n\\nEu gosto muito da ZONA SAFARI,\\nmas me perco sempre que vou!\\n\\nCom tanta grama!\\nCom tantos lugares!\\n\\nBem, eu precisava contar\\npara alguém!\\n\\nEnfim, lá vou eu na ZONA SAFARI\\noutra vez. Te vejo depois!"},
  {"g3:082ac914", "Hello, {02} here.\\nYes, correct, I am rich, yes.\\n\\nI should tell you, my wealth has\\ngrown since we last met.\\n\\nWhat's more, my POKéMON have also\\ngrown stronger.\\n\\nI can't shake the feeling that\\nthis world exists for me!\\n\\nOh, no need to say a word!\\nEveryone knows it's true!\\n\\nOh, you must excuse me, I have this\\nformal dinner to attend.", "Olá, É {02} aqui.\\nSim, correto, eu sou rico, sim.\\n\\nDevo dizer-lhe, minha riqueza dobro\\ndesde nosso último encontro.\\n\\nAlém disso, meus POKéMON\\ntambém estÃo fortes.\\n\\nEu acredito que este mundo\\nde rico é para mim!\\n\\nAh, nÃo fale uma palavra!\\nTodo mundo sabe que é verdade!\\n\\nOh, perdoe me, mas eu tenho um\\njantar formal para participar."},
  {"g3:082aca59", "Ufufufufu...\\nIt's me, {02}...\\n\\nCan you guess what I'm seeing?\\nA pair of {03} in a battle.\\n\\nMaybe I'll try catching the winner...\\nUfufufufufu...\\n\\nI... I'm kind of busy now.\\nI have to go.", "Ufufufu...\\nÉ {02}...\\n\\nVocê nÃo adivinha o que eu estou\\nvendo? Um par de {03} em\\n\\numa batalha.\\n\\nTalvez eu tente pegar o vencedor...\\nUfufufufu...\\n\\nEstou com sorte agora.\\nEu tenho que ir."},
  {"g3:082acb02", "Oh, it's {02}!\\n\\nI was just thinking I'm getting\\nbored of the ABANDONED SHIP.\\n\\nBut since I'm already here,\\nand I want to beat you once,\\n\\nI'll be sticking around a bit more.\\n\\nIf you feel compelled, why don't\\nyou come see me?\\n\\nI think today will be the day that\\nI finally challenge the man next\\n\\ndoor to a match.\\n\\nBe seeing you!", "Oh, alô, sou eu {02}!\\n\\nAcho que já estou chateada\\naqui no NAVIO ABANDONADO.\\n\\nMas, já que estou, gostaria de\\nbatalhar contigo e ganhar.\\n\\nVou ficar aqui um pouco mais.\\n\\nO que acha, Por que você nÃo\\nvem aqui me ver?\\n\\nDe hoje nÃo passa tenho que\\ndesafiar o da cabine ao lado.\\n\\nEstarei te esperando.\\nNos vemos depois! Tchau!"},
  {"g3:082acc3f", "I'm {02}!\\nThe man of the sea!\\n\\nYou know what I think?\\n\\nThe TRAINERS out at sea are\\nthe toughest of the tough!\\n\\nYou should learn from me and train\\nin the sea...\\n\\nWhoops, giant surf rising!\\n\\nIt's a great training opportunity!\\nSorry, but I have to go!", "Sou eu {02}!\\nO amante do mar!\\n\\nSabe o que acho?\\n\\nAcho que os TREINADORES\\ndo mar sÃo os mais fortes!\\n\\nDeveria aprender de mim\\ne vim treinar aqui no mar...\\n\\nUaaaaaaaa, uma onda gigante!\\n\\nQue oportunidade para entrar!\\nDesculpe, mas tenho que ir agora!"},
  {"g3:082acd2f", "It's {02}! Listen, I've been\\nteaching karate to my POKéMON.\\n\\nBut now they're better than me!\\nI've done nothing but lose to them!\\n\\nBut even though I may lose to\\nPOKéMON, I won't lose to another\\n\\nTRAINER, no sir!\\n\\nWe have to battle again!\\nUgwaah!", "É {02}! Ouça, eu tenho ensinado\\nkaratê aos meus POKéMON.\\n\\nMas agora estÃo melhores do que eu,\\ncomo eu fui perder pra eles.\\n\\nMas, mesmo que eu perca para um\\nPOKéMON, nÃo perderei para outro\\n\\nTREINADOR!\\n\\nTemos que lutar de novo!   \\nUgwaah! Tchau!"},
  {"g3:082ace1e", "It's me, {02}.\\nHow're your travels unwinding?\\n\\n...Whoa, is that right?\\nSounds awfully stimulating!\\n\\nI think I could write a song about\\none of your episodes.\\n\\n...Oh, hey, I'm feeling it.\\nI hear the riffs in my head.\\n\\nI'd better get this tune properly\\nwritten, so I've got to fly! Later!", "Sou eu, {02}.\\nComo vai as suas viagens?\\n\\n...Nossa, é mesmo?\\nSoa muito estimulante!\\n\\nAcho que eu poderia escrever uma\\nmúsica sobre um de seus episódios.\\n\\n... ...Oh, eu sinto isso.\\nEu ouço as notas na minha cabeça.\\n\\nÉ melhor eu começar esta música pela\\nletra, eu tenho que ir! Até depois!"},
  {"g3:082acf32", "This is {02}...\\nHear my new song.\\n\\nLalala, {03}, {03}!\\nWhy are you that {03}?\\n\\nWhy can't I be you, {03}?\\n\\nLala, {03} and {02},\\n\\n{02} and {03}...\\n\\nRepeat chorus, fade...", "É {02}...\\nOuça minha nova cançÃo.\\n\\nLala, {03}, {03}!\\nPor que você é esse {03}?\\n\\nPorque nÃo posso ser você,\\n\\n{03}?\\n\\nLala, {03} e {02},\\n\\n{02} e {03}...\\n\\nRepete o refrÃo..."},
  {"g3:082acfbe", "I'm {02}, you know,\\nthe camping expert!\\n\\nWhen we battled, I couldn't help\\nbut lose to you.\\n\\nAfter all, my expertise is in\\ncamping.\\n\\nBut win or lose, I like to battle\\nwhen I'm camping.\\n\\nBattle with us again, okay?\\nOh, and let's go camping, too!", "Sou eu {02}, você sabe,\\nespecialista em camping!\\n\\nQuando lutamos, eu nÃo pude\\nevitar perder para você.\\n\\nAfinal, minha especializaçÃo\\né em camping.\\n\\nMas ganhar ou perder,   \\neu gosto é de lutar.\\n\\nQuero revanche, ok?\\nAh, e vamos acampar, também!"},
  {"g3:082ad0ac", "It's me, me, {02}!\\n\\nI'd like to climb other mountains\\nthan this one, to be honest.\\n\\nBut I'm not sure if there'd be any\\nladies like on MT. CHIMNEY.\\n\\nIf you know any other mountain\\nwith ladies around, let me know!\\n\\nEhehehe, see you around!", "Sou eu, {02} falando!\\n\\nEu gostaria de escalar outras\\nmontanhas por aÍ.\\n\\nMas nÃo tenho certeza se tem\\nsenhoras lá no MT. CHAMINÉ.\\n\\nSe você conhece alguma outra\\nmontanha com senhoras em sua\\n\\nvolta, me avise!\\n\\nHehehehehe, te vejo por aÍ!"},
  {"g3:082ad194", "... ... ... ... ... ...\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n\\nIt's {02}...\\n\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n\\nThat's all today...", "... ... ... ... ... ...\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n\\nÉ {02}...\\n\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n\\nIsso é tudo, fim..."},
  {"g3:082ad1df", "This is {02}. Today, I had\\nthis feeling I would chat with you.\\n\\nMy desire to defeat you builds\\nby day and by night.\\n\\nYou have a rival like that, yes?\\nI wish it were me...\\n\\nI'm glad you heard me out.\\nSee you!", "É {02}. Hoje, tive um sentimento\\ne quero conversar com você.\\n\\nMeu desejo de te vencer constrói\\nde dia á noite.\\n\\nVocê tem um rival assim, nÃo é?\\nQueria que fosse eu...\\n\\nFico feliz que você me ouviu.\\nAté mais!"},
  {"g3:082ad2a8", "It's {02}.\\n\\nWhen there's a strong TRAINER\\nnearby, I can sometimes sense that\\n\\nsomehow.\\n\\nDid you pass close by, {01}{05}?\\nMaybe it was you.\\n\\nI'll be waiting for your visit.\\nBye!", "É {02}.\\n\\nQuando há um TREINADOR forte\\nperto, às vezes posso sentir\\n\\nde alguma forma.\\n\\nVocê passou por perto, {01}{05}?\\nTalvez fosse você.\\n\\nFico esperando por sua visita.\\nTchau!"},
  {"g3:082ad34f", "Hello, this is {02}.\\nYou sound well, {01}{05}.\\n\\nI've traveled around the world,\\nbut I must say I've taken a great\\n\\nshine to this region.\\n\\nI plan to stay here a while.\\nPerhaps we can meet again?\\n\\nI've not forgotten your dazzling\\ntechniques.\\n\\nI do hope for a rematch.", "Alô, é {02}.\\nVocê parece bem, {01}{05}.\\n\\nEu viajei ao redor do mundo,\\nmas devo dizer que amo com\\n\\npaixÃo a esta regiÃo.\\n\\nPretendo ficar aqui por um tempo.\\nTalvez nos vemos de novo?\\n\\nEu nÃo esqueci das suas técnicas\\ndeslumbrantes.\\n\\nEspero você para uma revanche."},
  {"g3:082ad44e", "Snivel... It's... {02}...\\n...Sob...\\n\\nROXANNE chewed me out in class\\ntoday.\\n\\nBut I don't dislike her or anything.\\n\\nROXANNE tells me exactly what\\nI did wrong so I can learn from it.\\n\\nYou bet I'll be going to\\nthe TRAINER'S SCHOOL tomorrow!\\n\\nSee you later!", "Snif... É... {02}...\\n...Ooh...\\n\\nROXANNE alertou-me na sala\\nde aula hoje.\\n\\nMas eu nÃo gosto dela, nem nada.\\n\\nROXANNE me disse exatamente o que\\neu fiz de errado, agora eu já sei.\\n\\nHm... Pode apostar que amanhÃ\\neu vou para ESCOLA!\\n\\nTe vejo mais tarde!"},
  {"g3:082ad53a", "It's {02}!\\n\\nROXANNE let me battle with her\\nyesterday.\\n\\nThe results...\\nTerrible, like you needed to ask.\\n\\nBut I was delighted that ROXANNE\\nwould even let me challenge her!\\n\\nYou wouldn't believe how much\\nmore I admire her!\\n\\nI'm going to really focus and work!\\nI'd better go!", "É {02}!\\n\\nROXANNE deixou eu\\ndisafiá-la ontem.\\n\\nOs resultados... TerrÍvel,\\nvocê nem precisava perguntar.\\n\\nMas fiquei muito feliz que ROXANNE\\ndeixou eu desafiá-la!\\n\\nVocê nÃo vai acreditar o quanto \\nmais eu admiro ela!\\n\\nVou me concentrar e treinar mais!\\nBem, é melhor eu ir!"},
  {"g3:082ad642", "Hi, it's ANNA! I'm with my junior\\npartner MEG again today.\\n\\nI really love caring for MEG and\\nPOKéMON. They're so cute!\\n\\nI wish I could look after them\\nas if they were my siblings!\\n\\nOh, hi, MEG!\\nDid you get the buns?\\n\\nHuh? No, no, I'm not treating you\\nlike my personal slave!\\n\\nYou lost the match, so you have\\nto go buy the bread as punishment!\\n\\nI wouldn't treat you like a slave,\\nMEG! You're too special to me!\\n\\nI have to go now.\\nIt's time for our snack!", "Oi, é ANNA! Estou com o minha\\nparceira MEG novamente hoje.\\n\\nRealmente amo cuidar de MEG e\\nPOKéMON. Eles sÃo tÃo bonitos!\\n\\nEu gostaria de poder cuidar deles\\ncomo se fossem meus irmÃos!\\n\\nOh, oi, oi, MEG!\\nVocê conseguiu os pÃes?\\n\\nEi? NÃo, eu nÃo estou te tratando\\ncomo meu escravo pessoal!\\n\\nVocê perdeu, entÃo você tem\\nir comprar o pÃo como castigo!\\n\\nVocê nÃo é escrava, MEG!\\nVocê é muito especial para mim!\\n\\nEu tenho que ir agora.\\nÉ hora do nosso lanche!"},
  {"g3:082ad801", "I love POKéMON!\\nIt's {02} from the FAN CLUB!\\n\\nYou have to hear this!\\nMy sweet POKéMON...\\n\\nSnort! Wahaha!\\nI can't say any more! It's a secret!\\n\\nIt's just too cute for words!\\n\\nOh, my sweet {03} is begging\\nfor a POKéBLOCK!\\n\\nIt's the picture of cuteness!\\n\\nSorry, but I can't talk now!\\nYou'll have to hear this next time!", "Eu amo POKéMON!\\nÉ {02} do FÃ CLUB!\\n\\nVocê tem que ouvir isso!\\nMinha doce POKéMON...\\n\\nEu nÃo posso dizer! É um segredo!\\nÉ muito bonito para palavras!\\n\\nOh, minha querida {03} está\\nimplorando por uma POKéBLOCK!\\n\\nÉ a imagem da fofura!\\n\\nDesculpe, mas eu nÃo posso falar\\nagora! Você vai ter que ouvir isso\\n\\nna próxima vez!"},
  {"g3:082ad92e", "Ohoho!\\n\\nThis is {02}! I can't wait to\\ntell you about my darling POKéMON!\\n\\nPlease, you must listen to this.\\nIt's about my darling {03}.\\n\\nWhenever anyone picks it up,\\nit leaps straight into my arms!\\n\\nOh... Oh... Could there be anything\\nmore blissful?\\n\\nOh, it feels so heavenly!\\n\\nI'm so glad I could share some of\\nmy happiness with you.\\n\\nWell, I must be going.\\nBye, now!", "Ohohoho!\\n\\nAqui é {02}! NÃo posso esperar\\npara contar sobre o meu POKéMON!\\n\\nPor favor, você deve ouvir isso.\\nÉ sobre a minha querida {03}.\\n\\nSempre que alguém a pega,\\npula direto nos meus braços!\\n\\nOh... Pode haver algo mais feliz?\\n\\nOh, isso é tÃo celestial!\\n\\nEstou tÃo feliz que posso dividir \\nalgumas das minhas felicidades\\n\\ncom você.\\n\\nBem, preciso ir agora.\\nTchau!"},
  {"g3:082ada8f", "I am... {02}.\\nPeople call me an EXPERT.\\n\\nBut there is one thing I know.\\nI could not be an EXPERT on my own\\n\\npower.\\n\\nOnly with the help of POKéMON can\\na TRAINER become an EXPERT.\\n\\nHumph! I believe I may have said\\nsomething deep and profound!\\n\\nI shall leave you in good spirits!", "Sou eu... {02}.\\nAs pessoas me chamam de EXPERT.\\n\\nMas há uma coisa que eu sei.\\nEu nÃo poderia ser um EXPERT\\n\\ncom meu próprio poder.\\n\\nSó com a ajuda de POKéMON pode\\num TREINADOR ser EXPERT.\\n\\nUma ova! Eu acho que falei\\nalgo muito forte e profundo!\\n\\nÉ para te deixar de bom humor!"},
  {"g3:082adb9b", "It's {02}.\\nI'm glad to chat with you!\\n\\nI am feeling alive and refreshed\\nsoaking in this hot-spring tub.\\n\\nI've been battling young TRAINERS\\nsince we met, but you're still\\n\\nthe best of the lot.\\n\\nI imagine you'll become an EXPERT\\nin your old age! Ohohoho...", "It's {02}.\\nI'm glad to chat with you!\\n\\nI am feeling alive and refreshed\\nsoaking in this hot-spring tub.\\n\\nI've been battling young TRAINERS\\nsince we met, but you're still\\n\\nthe best of the lot.\\n\\nI imagine you'll become an EXPERT\\nin your old age! Ohohoho..."},
  {"g3:082adc92", "Yay! This is {02}!\\nWhat's up?\\n\\nI might be imagining this, but when\\nI win battles, my shorts seem to\\n\\nfeel, like, better. Materially.\\n\\nWhat do I mean by that?\\nIt's kind of hard to explain, but...\\n\\nHow would I say this now...\\n\\nMy shorts feel silkier!\\n\\nAnd when I battled you, {01}{05},\\nmy shorts felt icky and coarse.\\n\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\nYou didn't really believe that?\\n\\nEhehehe, that's all! Bye now!", "Ei! Aqui é {02}!\\nEscute isso?\\n\\nEu posso estar imaginando, mas\\nquando eu ganho batalhas, meu\\n\\nshorts parece sentir, gostar.\\n\\nMaterialmente.\\n\\nO que quero dizer com isso?\\nÉ difÍcil de explicar, mas...\\n\\nComo eu posso dizer isso...\\n\\nMeu shorts tá mais sedoso!\\n\\nE quando enfrentei você, {01}{05},\\nmeu shorts ficou nojento e grosso.\\n\\n... ... ... ... ... ... ...\\nVocê realmente nÃo acredita nisso?\\n\\nEhehehe, Tchau!"},
  {"g3:082ade08", "Ahoy!\\n{02} here!\\n\\nAs always, I'm fishing with wild\\nabandon!\\n\\nAre there other places I can fish\\nthan the sea and rivers?\\n\\nI get these powerful urges to\\nfish just about anywhere!\\n\\nOh, gosh, darn it!\\nMy line's tangled up!\\n\\nGotta go!\\nFind me some new fishing spots!", "Ahoy!\\nÉ eu {02}!\\n\\nComo sempre estou\\npescando sozinho!\\n\\nHá outros lugares para pescar\\ndo que o mar e os rios?\\n\\nSinto fortes impulsos para\\npescar em qualquer lugar!\\n\\nOh, Deus!\\nMinha linha está emaranhada!\\n\\nTenho que ir!\\nEncontre-me alguns pontos\\n\\nde pesca novos."},
  {"g3:082adf07", "Hey, there! It's {02}.\\nAre you taking it casually?\\n\\nEver since I was a kid, you know,\\nI've always been placid, huh?\\n\\nI never was much for getting all\\nstressed or rushing things.\\n\\nBut wouldn't you know it,\\nI'm now a TRIATHLETE.\\n\\nYou just can't tell where life will\\ntake you, if you get my drift.\\n\\nYou're a TRAINER now, but who\\nknows what the future holds, huh?\\n\\nImagine yourself as a teacher,\\nor maybe an artist. Cool, huh?\\n\\nBut, hey, be cool. Take it casual.\\nSee you around.", "Alô, aqui é {02}.\\nComo está seu espÍrito esportivo?\\n\\nEu sempre faço as coisas\\ncom calma, desde criança.\\n\\nEu nunca gostei de fazer nada\\ncorrendo e sem pensar.\\n\\nMas, veja como que sÃo as\\ncoisas, agora sou TRIATLETA.\\n\\nNunca sabe por onde a vida vai\\nte levar, se é que me entende.\\n\\nAgora se dedica a TREINAR,\\nmas quem sabe o futuro, né?\\n\\nImagine-se dando aula na classe,\\nou talvez um artista. Legal, nÃo?\\n\\nMas, nesse momento eu quero ser\\nesportista. EntÃo nos vemos por aÍ."},
  {"g3:082ae0d9", "This is {02}!\\nI'm cycling right now.\\n\\nI love swimming and running,\\nbut cycling is my first love!\\n\\nIt makes my whole body feel as if\\nI'm one with the wind.\\n\\nIt exhilarates me as if I were\\nflying!\\n\\nOkay! Today, I'm going to set a new\\nCYCLING ROAD record!\\n\\nYou should make the challenge, too!\\nSee you!", "Aqui é {02}!\\nEstou na bike agora.\\n\\nNadar e correr me encanta,\\nmas ciclismo e minha paixÃo...\\n\\nMe faz sentir que o vento e eu\\nsomos um só.\\n\\nMe faz sentir como se pudesse\\nvoar livre!\\n\\nEscute! Hoje eu penso em bater\\no record lá na CICLOVIA!\\n\\nVocê deveria tentar esse desafio\\ntambém. Até logo... Tchau!"},
  {"g3:082ae1fd", "Yo, this is {02}! I'm smack\\nin the middle of a triathlon!\\n\\nBut, hey, I've always got time to\\nshoot the breeze!\\n\\nWorking out with POKéMON feels\\nmighty good!\\n\\nWithout exchanging words, we synch\\nas if we shared a heart.\\n\\nIt's inspiring!\\n\\nGasp... Chatting while running...\\nI'm getting run down...\\n\\nGasp... Have...to...go...", "Aqui é {02}! Olha estou\\nno meio de um triathlon!\\n\\nMas, eu sempre tenho tempo\\npara curtir uma brisa suave!\\n\\nEstar com POKéMON é muito bom!\\n\\nSem trocar palavras, sincronizamos\\ncomo se fosse um só coraçÃo.\\n\\nÉ muito inspirador!\\n\\nAh... Conversando durante a corrida...\\nEstou ficando para trás...\\n\\nEu tenho... que... ir..."},
  {"g3:082ae327", "Hi, it's {02}.\\nIf you want to improve endurance,\\n\\nhigh-altitude training is it!\\n\\nTry running on a mountaintop.\\nYou'll be gasping in no time!\\n\\nI'm getting oxygen starved, too!\\nSee you!", "Oi, sou eu {02}.\\nSe quer melhorar a resistência,\\n\\ntreine em altitude elevada é isso!\\n\\nTente subir uma montanha.\\nVocê ficará ofegante rápido!\\n\\nAh... Estou sem oxigênio, também!\\nAté mais!"},
  {"g3:082ae3da", "Oh, it's {02}, hello.\\n\\nI've been swimming a lot but I still\\ncan't seem to reach EVERGRANDE.\\n\\nMaybe I'm just going in circles.\\n\\nNo, no, that can't be possible.\\nWahahaha.\\n\\nTake care!", "Oh, é {02}, olá.\\n\\nTenho nadado muito, mas ainda nÃo\\nconsigui chegar na ILHA COLOSSAL.\\n\\nTalvez eu esteja nadando em cÍrculo.\\n\\nNÃo, nÃo, isso nÃo pode ser possÍvel.\\nAahahaha.\\n\\nTchau!"},
  {"g3:082ae489", "Hey, it's {02}...\\nWhoops!\\n\\nSplash!\\n\\nBlug-blug-blug-blug...\\n\\nSploosh!\\n\\nWhiff-whiff! Whiff-whiff!\\n\\nHey! Sorry about that!\\nI just put on some suntan oil.\\n\\nSo my POKéNAV went whoopsy\\nout of my hand into the water!\\n\\nBut, boy, DEVON's POKéNAV is built\\ntough. It survived that dunking!\\n\\nAnyways, I'm busy sunbathing,\\nso let's chat another time.", "Eh, sou {02}...\\nOps!\\n\\nSplash!\\n\\nGlub-glub-glub-glub...\\n\\nSploosh!\\n\\nWhiff-whiff! Whiff-whiff!\\n\\nEi! Desculpe! É que acabei\\nde passar protetor solar, e\\n\\nesbarrei em minha POKéNAV\\n\\nque acabou de caiu na água!\\n\\nMas, veja, a POKéNAV da DEVON\\ne muito resistente. NÃo se afogou!\\n\\nBem, agora eu estou tomando sol,\\nfalamos em outro momento, tudo bem?"},
  {"g3:082ae5cd", "Hello, this is {02}.\\n\\nOut of the three triathlon events,\\nI like swimming best.\\n\\nBut if I stay in the sea too long,\\nwon't I get all prune-like?\\n\\nOoh, triathlon is such a grueling\\ntest of human endurance! Bye!", "Olá, é {02}.\\n\\nDe todas as provas do triathlon,\\na nataçÃo é a melhor.\\n\\nMas ficar de molho muito tempo,\\nvou parecer um grÃo de bico?\\n\\nOoh, o triathlon é uma prova de\\nfogo para a resistência fÍsica!\\n\\nAté logo!"},
  {"g3:082ae698", "Hello, {01}{05}.\\n{02} here.\\n\\nHow are your POKéMON doing?\\n\\nMy DRAGON POKéMON appear to be\\nin peak form. Bye for now.", "Olá, {01}{05}.\\nÉ {02}.\\n\\nCamo vai seus POKéMON?\\n\\nMeu POKéMON DRAGÃO parece está\\nno auge da sua boa forma. Até logo."},
  {"g3:082ae704", "{02} here.\\n\\nMy {03} has grown even more\\ntough than that last time.\\n\\nI'm not going to lose again to you.\\nYou wait till next time!\\n\\nSee you around!", "É {02}.\\n\\nMeu {03} cresceu e estar\\nmais forte do que a última vez.\\n\\nEu nÃo vou perder de novo para\\nvocê. Espere até a próxima!\\n\\nVejo você por aÍ!"},
  {"g3:082ae78f", "It is {02} here.\\n\\nI have continued with my studies\\nin the art of concealment.\\n\\nBut I have been too successful.\\nNo one has been able to find me.\\n\\nMy success makes me lonely...\\n\\nLike smoke I disappear!\\nFarewell!", "É {02} aqui.\\n\\nEu continuei com os meus estudos\\nna arte da dissimulaçÃo.\\n\\nMas já tem sido muito bem sucedido.\\nNinguém foi capaz de me encontrar.\\n\\nMeu sucesso me faz solitário...\\n\\nComo fumaça desapareço!\\nAdeus!"},
  {"g3:082ae859", "This is {02}.\\nI kept up my training since we met.\\n\\nMy {03} is getting pretty\\ntough.\\n\\nTraining on a beach is effective,\\njust as I thought. Bye now!", "É {02}.\\nEu mantive meu treino desde que\\n\\nnos conhecemos.\\n\\nMeu {03} está ficando muito\\nforte.\\n\\nTreinar em uma praia é eficaz,\\nassim como eu pensava."},
  {"g3:082ae8e6", "How do you do?\\nThis is {02}.\\n\\nI wonder when this yucky volcanic\\nash will stop falling?\\n\\nIf it gets too deep, it will cover\\nup the pattern on my parasol...\\n\\nLet's promise to meet again!", "Como vai?\\nAqui é {02}.\\n\\nQueria saber quando está nojenta\\ncinzas vulcânica vÃo parar de cair?\\n\\nSe cair muito, vai cobrir   \\ntodo o meu guarda-sol...\\n\\nVamos prometer nos vemos\\nnovamente!"},
  {"g3:082ae998", "Hi, {02} here.\\n\\nDid you know that it's easier to\\nfloat in the sea than a pool?\\n\\nJust by lying still, your body will\\nfloat on its own.\\n\\nBut if you float for too long,\\nwatch that you don't get carried\\n\\noff too far out.\\n\\n...Where am I, anyway?\\nI'd better go!", "Oi, É {02}.\\n\\nSabia que é mais fácil boiar\\nno mar do que em uma piscina?\\n\\nÉ só ficar quieto e seu corpo\\nflutua sozinho.\\n\\nMas nÃo fique boiando por muito\\ntempo, senÃo vai que te arraste\\n\\na corrente mar adentro.\\n\\nVixi... Aonde estou, agora?\\nÉ melhor voltar!"},
  {"g3:082aea8f", "Oh, {01}{05}, hello!\\nThis is {02}.\\n\\nI'm up in the mountains now.\\n\\nBut the ground is too bumpy.\\nI can't pitch my tent here...\\n\\nOh, I had a brilliant idea!\\n\\nMaybe I can get my POKéMON to tamp\\nthe ground flat here!\\n\\nI'm going to try that!\\nBye-bye!", "Oh, {01}{05}, oi!\\nAqui é {02}.\\n\\nEu estou nas montanhas agora.\\n\\nMas o terreno é muito acidentado.\\nNÃo posso armar a barraca aqui...\\n\\nAh, eu tive uma idéia brilhante!\\n\\nTalvez meu POKéMON deixe\\no terreno plano aqui!\\n\\nEu vou tentar isso!\\nBye-bye!"},
  {"g3:082aeb77", "Oh, hi, hi, this is {02}!\\n\\nI'm raising POKéMON with LIV!\\nWe're trying very hard!\\n\\nIf we try harder, can we become\\nnumber one? Bye-bye!", "Oh, oi, oi, é {02}!\\n\\nEu estou treinando POKéMON com LIV!\\nAh... Que esforço!\\n\\nSe treinarmos muito, podemos nos\\ntornar o número um? Tchau!"},
  {"g3:082aebfa", "{02} here!\\n\\nI'm a SAILOR, but I'm not on a boat\\nnow.\\n\\nIt makes me wonder--what should\\na SAILOR on land be called?\\n\\nThat's what I've been thinking\\nwhile staring out across the waves.\\n\\nAll right, next time!", "Sou eu {02}!\\n\\nSou um marinheiro, mas nÃo\\nestou abordo agora.\\n\\nEu fico pensando... o que um\\nmarinheiro em terra é chamado?\\n\\nÉ o que eu fico pensado enquanto\\nolhava longe através das ondas.\\n\\nAté logo! Tchau!"},
  {"g3:082aecc1", "It's {02}.\\nSo? Get any more POKéMON?\\n\\nIf you catch a new POKéMON,\\nyou have to come show me.\\n\\nI won't whine for it, honest.\\nI'll be waiting. See you.", "É {02}.\\nEntÃo? Capturou mais POKéMON?\\n\\nSe você pegar um novo POKéMON,\\nvocê tem que vir me mostrar.\\n\\nEu nÃo vou reclamar.\\nFico te esperando. Tchau."},
  {"g3:082aed52", "This is {02}.\\n\\nAre you raising your POKéMON\\nin the optimal way?\\n\\nThe air is clean where I am.\\nIt's the perfect environment for\\n\\nraising POKéMON.\\n\\nIf you're going to focus on raising\\nPOKéMON, you should come out to\\n\\n{03}. Take care now.", "Aqui é {02}.\\n\\nVocê elevou seus POKéMON\\nde forma equilibrada?\\n\\nO ar é limpo onde estou.\\nÉ o ambiente perfeito para\\n\\npoder treinar os POKéMON.\\n\\nSe vai se concentrar em elevar\\nPOKéMON, você deve ir lá para\\n\\n{03}. E tenha muito cuidado."},
  {"g3:082aee35", "Hi, this is {02}.\\n\\nI gave a POKéBLOCK to my {03}.\\nIt seemed to enjoy it very much.\\n\\nIt looks like POKéMON have their\\nlikes and dislikes with POKéBLOCKS.\\n\\nI find that quite fascinating.\\nPlease do take care.", "Oi, aqui é {02}.\\n\\nEu dei uma POKéBLOCK para meu\\n{03}. Parceu-me gostar muito.\\n\\nParece que POKéMON tem seus\\ngostos e desgostos com POKéBLOCKS.\\n\\nEu acho isso muito fascinante.\\nPor favor, teste com cuidado."},
  {"g3:082aeef4", "{02} here.\\n\\nIf you cooperate with POKéMON,\\none can be comfortable in the wild.\\n\\nEveryone should realize that and\\ncooperate with POKéMON more.\\n\\nThat would be ideal.\\nI really think so.\\n\\nI think you're on the right track!\\nCatch you later!", "É {02}.\\n\\nSe você colaborar com os POKéMON,\\nvocê fica seguro até na selva.\\n\\nTodo mundo deveria perceber e\\ncooperar mais com os POKéMON.\\n\\nIsso seria o ideal.\\nEu realmente acho que sim.\\n\\nEu acho que você está no caminho\\ncerto! Até logo!"},
  {"g3:082aefda", "Hi, it's {02}. You know,\\nthe TRAINER who's always prepared!\\n\\n{01}{05}, do you have enough items?\\nAre your POKéMON fit for action?\\n\\nKeeping everything perfect around\\nyou all the time is the secret to\\n\\nkeeping your journey going.\\n\\nI'd better go check my own\\nsupplies! Be vigilant!", "Oi, é {02}.\\nVocê sabe, a TREINADORA que está\\n\\nsempre alerta!\\n\\n{01}{05}, você ainda tem items?\\nSeus POKéMON sÃo aptos para a açÃo?\\n\\nMantendo tudo perfeito em sua\\nvolta o tempo todo é o segredo\\n\\npara manter a sua jornada.\\n\\nÉ melhor eu ir ver os meus\\nsuprimentos! Esteja vigilante!"},
  {"g3:082af0e7", "It's {02}!\\nIt's {02}!\\n\\n{03} is a very busy\\nthoroughfare, so I get challenged\\n\\nby all kinds of TRAINERS every day.\\n\\nToday, I won five battles and lost\\nonly three!\\n\\nHow did you do today?\\nTell me about it next time, okay?", "É {02}!\\nÉ {02}!\\n\\n{03} é muito movimentada, por \\nisso eu desafio todos os tipos de\\n\\nTREINADORES a cada dia.\\n\\nHoje, eu ganhei 5 batalhas\\ne perdi apenas 3!\\n\\nQuantas você fez hoje? Conte-me\\nsobre isso na próxima vez, ok?"},
  {"g3:082af1b8", "It's me, {02}.\\n\\nI'm popular because I have lots\\nof BUG POKéMON, right?\\n\\nWell, I took a bunch of my fave\\nbugs to school today.\\n\\nThis girl I like started crying!\\nGo ahead and laugh if you want.\\n\\nI have to try teaching her what\\nmakes BUG POKéMON so appealing.\\n\\nSnivel...\\nSee you!", "Sou eu, {02}.\\n\\nEu sou popular porque tenho muitos\\nPOKéMON INSETOS, certo?\\n\\nBem, eu levei meus POKéMON\\nfavoritos para escola hoje.\\n\\nA menina que eu gosto\\ncomeçou a chorar.\\n\\nVá em frente e rir, se quiser.\\n\\nVou tentar ensiná-la o que\\nfaz INSETOS tÃo atraentes.\\n\\nSniff...\\nAté logo!"},
  {"g3:082af2c4", "Hah! Hah! Hah! Hah!\\n\\nHi! It's {02}! Hah! Hah!\\n\\nTrying to chat...\\nWhile climbing...\\n\\nIs harsh exercise... Hah! Hah!\\n\\nUrgh! Oof...\\nIt's steeper now...\\n\\nWe'll chat...another time...\\n\\nHah! Hah! Hah!", "Hah! Hah! Hah! Hah! \\n\\nOi! É {02}! Hah! Hah!\\n\\nTentando conversar...\\nEm uma escalada...\\n\\nÉ um exercÍcio duro... Hah!!\\n\\nUrgh! Ufa...\\nAgora eu cansei...\\n\\nVamos conversar... depois...\\n\\nHah! Hah! Hah!"},
  {"g3:082af371", "Oh, hi!\\n\\nI'm still searching for treasures\\nwith KIRA!\\n\\nMaybe there isn't any treasure\\nhere at all...\\n\\nBut the important thing is for me\\nto search alongside KIRA.\\n\\nOh, hey, KIRA!\\nWh-why are you angry?\\n\\nI'm not ignoring you, honey!\\nYou're my one and only!\\n\\n...{01}, I have to go, bye!", "Ah, oi!\\n\\nAinda estou procurando\\ntesoutos com KIRA!\\n\\nPode se que no final nÃo há nenhum\\ntesouro por aqui...\\n\\nMas para mim o umportante\\ne poder procurar com KIRA.\\n\\nOh, olá, KIRA!\\nPor que está brava?\\n\\nNÃo ignorei você, amor!\\nVocê é a única que me importa!\\n\\n{01}, tenho que ir, tchau!"},
  {"g3:082af480", "This is {02}!\\n\\nI went to DEWFORD's GYM again\\nfor training.\\n\\nBRAWLY, the GYM LEADER, seems\\nto be tougher now.\\n\\nSomething about being toughened\\nby the wild waves...\\n\\nBut he's still as cool as ever.\\nThe ladies adore him!\\n\\nIt makes me envious, frankly.\\n\\nI wonder... Is his friend BRUNO\\nthe same way as BRAWLY?\\n\\nYou know, all sweaty or smelly,\\nand prone to calling people\\n\\n«big wave,» that sort of thing.\\n\\nBut, hey, this jealousy thing isn't\\nvery seemly, is it?\\n\\nForget this chat ever happened,\\nhow about it? So long!", "Aqui é {02}!\\n\\nEu fui outra vez ao GINÁSIO\\nde DEWFORD para treinar.\\n\\nBRAWLY, o LÍDER do GINÁSIO,\\nparece agora mais forte que antes.\\n\\nAcho que se fortaleceu\\ncom a força das ondas...\\n\\nMas segue ainda um tipo genial.\\nAs mulheres o adoram!\\n\\nIsso me dá inveja, sério.\\n\\nMe pergunto... Tú acha que o\\nBRUNO se parece com BRAWLY?\\n\\nJá sabe, todo orgulhoso e doce,\\nsempre querendo ser melhor\\n\\nque a gente e essas coisas.\\n\\nMas, parece que sÃo os mesmos\\nque falam comigo, acredite?\\n\\nEsqueça essa conversa,\\ntudo bem? Até logo!"},
  {"g3:082af671", "It's a pleasure to chat with\\na young TRAINER like you.\\n\\nI imagine that you will continue to\\nenjoy POKéMON whatever your age.\\n\\nWouldn't it be good if you had\\na partnership like ours?\\n\\nOf course, {01}{05}, you already\\nenjoy the trust and companionship\\n\\nof your POKéMON now.\\n\\nYou have the makings of long and\\nenduring relationships already!\\n\\nHahaha!\\nNever be discouraged!", "É um prazer conversar com um\\nTREINADOR jovem como você.\\n\\nImagino que vai continuar a gostar\\nde POKéMON em qualquer idade.\\n\\nNÃo seria bom se você tivesse\\numa parceria como a nossa?\\n\\nClaro, {01}{05}, você já desfruta\\nda confiança e companheirismo\\n\\nde seus POKéMON agora.\\n\\nVocê já tem o resultado de um longo\\ne duradouro relacionamento!\\n\\nHahahaha!\\nEntÃo nunca desanime!"},
  {"g3:082af7d8", "Hi, this is {02}!\\nWe just won a battle!\\n\\nWe don't win often, but it was this\\ncool SWIMMER guy.\\n\\nMy sister was steamed!\\n\\nShe wanted to pretend that she\\nwas weak to make an impression!\\n\\nShe always chews me out whether\\nwe win or lose!\\n\\n{01}{05}, can you say something\\nto her next time?\\n\\nOkay, see you!", "Oi, aqui é {02}!\\nAcabamos de ganhar uma luta!\\n\\nNÃo ganhamos muito, mas foi\\ncontra um NADADOR bem legal.\\n\\nMinha irmÃ estava brava!\\n\\nSe enfurece fácil para chamar\\na minha atençÃo!\\n\\nÉ igual se ganha ou perde,\\nsempre me dá sermÃo!\\n\\n{01}{05}, por que nÃo me dá\\numas dicas na próxima vez?\\n\\nCerto, tchau!"},
  {"g3:082af8f7", "{02} here, yes.\\nI headed out to sea yesterday.\\n\\nI had been hoping to find a new\\nruin to explore.\\n\\nBut the tides somehow seemed to\\ncarry me back where I started.\\n\\nI'm still weak at battling, too...\\nFeel free to mock me...\\n\\nBut I won't give up.\\n\\nMy day will come when I discover\\na new ruin!\\n\\nThat's all I have to say!\\nFarewell for now!", "Sou {02}, sim.\\nEu estava no mar ontem.\\n\\nEsperava descobrir alguma ruÍna\\nnova para explorar.\\n\\nMas as ondas me jogava para\\ncosta. NÃo tinha jeito, é sério.\\n\\nEm batalhas ainda nÃo melhorei...\\nPode rir se quiser...\\n\\nmas nÃo penso em desistir.\\n\\nChegará o dia que descubrirei\\nruÍnas inexploradas!\\n\\nIsso é tudo que te digo!\\nAté logo! Tchau!"},
  {"g3:082afa39", "Ahoy there!\\nIt's me, {02}!\\n\\nI'm out on ROUTE 108 now!\\n\\nIn other words, where I always am!\\n\\nToday, a gorgeous SWIMMER \\nswam by me!\\n\\nSo I startled her with a shout!\\n\\nAnd she gave me a nasty glare!\\n\\nThat's all from ROUTE 108!\\nBrought to you by {02}!", "Ahoy! Sou eu, {02}!\\nEstou na ROTA 108!\\n\\nOnde sempre fico.\\n\\nHoje eu esbarrei com uma\\nNADADORA espetacular!\\n\\nEntÃo soltei meu grito!\\n\\nParece que nÃo gostou, porque\\nme lançou um olhar de arrepiar!\\n\\nIsso é tudo daqui da ROTA 108!\\nCâmbio e desligo! Aqui é {02}!"},
  {"g3:082afb26", "It's {02}!\\n\\nI'm kind of busy, but I figured\\nI should let you know that I've\\n\\nbeaten five TRAINERS again today.\\n\\nIf I keep this pace up, I can\\nprobably beat you next time.\\n\\nI think we'll be good rivals,\\nyou and I. Good-bye for now!", "É {02}!\\n\\nSou do tipo ocupado, mas percebi\\nque deveria te informar que eu tenho\\n\\nespancado 5 TREINADORES hoje.\\n\\nSe continuar nesse ritmo, é bem\\nprovável te vencer na próxima vez.\\n\\nAcho que vamos ser bons rivais,\\nvocê e eu. Tchau!"},
  {"g3:082afc07", "Hi! This is {02}.\\nI heard the news!\\n\\nThey say you did excellent at\\nthe {03}.\\n\\nIt's awesome, {04} straight wins?\\nSee you!", "Oi! É {02}.\\nOuvi a notÍcia!\\n\\nDzem que você fez excelente\\nno {03}.\\n\\nÉ impressionante, {04} vitórias seguidas?\\nAté mais!"},
  {"g3:082afc78", "Hello, it's {02}!\\nI heard about you!\\n\\nThey said you won {04} straight\\nbattles at the {03}.\\n\\nThat's special! I should try\\nharder, too! See you!", "Alô, é {02}!\\nEu ouvi sobre você!\\n\\nDizem que você ganhou {04} combates\\nseguidos no {03}.\\n\\nIsso é tÃo especial! Eu deveria tentar\\nmais! Tchau!"},
  {"g3:082afcff", "Hey there, {01}!\\nIt's me, {02}.\\n\\nI heard you went on a tear at\\nthe {03}!\\n\\nA big {04}-win streak...\\nThat is a big record, isn't it?\\n\\nI'd better get it together, too!\\nCatch you soon!", "Ei, {01}!\\nSou eu, {02}.\\n\\nOuvi dizer que você foi sensacional\\nna {03}!\\n\\nUau, {04}-sequências de vitórias...\\nÉ um grande record, nÃo é?\\n\\nÉ melhor eu tentar, também!\\nEntÃo, até mais!"},
  {"g3:082afda7", "Hey, {01}{05}.\\n{02} here. What's up?\\n\\nThere's a rumor going around that\\nyou strung together {04} straight\\n\\nwins at the {03}.\\n\\nI'd better step it up, too.\\nSee you!", "Olá, {01}{05}.\\nSou eu {02}. O que houve?\\n\\nHá um boato de que você foi\\ncapar de conseguir {04} vitórias\\n\\nseguidas na {03}.\\n\\nÉ melhor eu melhorar, também.\\nAté mais!"},
  {"g3:082afe3d", "Hiya, {01}{05}!\\nIt's {02}.\\n\\nYou were at the {03}\\nand won {04} battles in a row?\\n\\nIsn't that something!\\n\\nI'd better work on my POKéMON more.\\nSee you soon!", "Hiya, {01}{05}!\\nIt's {02}.\\n\\nYou were at the {03}\\nand won {04} battles in a row?\\n\\nIsn't that something!\\n\\nI'd better work on my POKéMON more.\\nSee you soon!"},
  {"g3:082afeca", "Hey, {01}{05}.\\n{02} here. How are you?\\n\\nBy the way, I heard you pulled off\\nthe feat of {04} straight wins at\\n\\nthe {03}.\\n\\nThat inspires me to focus on\\nraising my team.", "Ei, {01}{05}.\\nÉ {02} aqui. Como vai?\\n\\nQue bom, ouvi dizer que você teve\\na proeza de {04} vitórias seguidas\\n\\nno {03}.\\n\\nIsso me inspira a focar\\nem elevar minha equipe."},
  {"g3:082aff64", "...Er, {01}{05}?\\n{02} here...\\n\\nOh, yeah, you were over at\\nthe {03}, right?\\n\\nAnd you won {04} battles in a row.\\n\\nOh, there goes a rare POKéMON!\\nI have to go!", "...Er, {01}{05}?\\n{02} here...\\n\\nOh, yeah, you were over at\\nthe {03}, right?\\n\\nAnd you won {04} battles in a row.\\n\\nOh, there goes a rare POKéMON!\\nI have to go!"},
  {"g3:082afff0", "Oh, {01}{05}, how do you do?\\nThis is {02} speaking.\\n\\nI hope you're doing well.\\n\\nOh, but, you are. I've heard that\\nyou won {04} matches in a row at\\n\\nthe {03}.\\n\\nThat's very impressive!\\nI hope you stay successful.", "Oh, {01}{05}, como vai?\\nAqui é {02} falando.\\n\\nEspero que esteja bem.\\n\\nOh, mas, foi você? Eu ouvir que\\nvocê venceu {04} partidas seguidas\\n\\nlá na {03}.\\n\\nIsso é muito incrÍvel!\\nEspero que continue com sucesso."},
  {"g3:082b00b5", "Oh, {01}{05}, hi there!\\nThis is {02}!\\n\\nI heard! Your {04}-win streak at\\nthe {03}!\\n\\nThat is so cool!\\nI'd better try harder, too!", "Oh, {01}{05}, oi!\\nÉ {02}!\\n\\nEu ouvi! Nossa! {04}-vitórias seguidas\\nna {03}!\\n\\nIsso é tÃo legal!\\nÉ melhor eu tentar mais, também!"},
  {"g3:082b0129", "Oh, {01}{05}, hello...\\nThis is {02}.\\n\\nYou won {04} straight battles at\\nthe {03}?\\n\\nThat's quite the accomplishment.\\nI need to work harder.", "Oh, {01}{05}, olá...\\nSou eu {02}.\\n\\nVocê ganhou {04} combates seguidos\\nna {03}?\\n\\nIsso é bastante conquista.\\nEu preciso treinar muito mais."},
  {"g3:082b01a5", "Ah, {01}{05}.\\nThis is {02}.\\n\\nI hear you're the terror of\\nthe {03}?\\n\\nYou won, what, {04} matches in\\na row?\\n\\nYou're good, you.\\nI wonder how many I can win?", "Ah, {01}{05}.\\nÉ {02}.\\n\\nOuvi dizer que você é o terror\\ndo {03}?\\n\\nVocê venceu, {04} partidas\\nem sequencia?\\n\\nAaah! Me pergunto quantas\\neu poderia vencer?"},
  {"g3:082b0232", "Hello, {01}{05}.\\nIt's me, {02}.\\n\\nAre you keeping well?\\n\\nSomeone passed on word about you.\\nHow you won {04} straight battles\\n\\nat a place named {03}?\\n\\nThat's quite the tale.\\nSee you!", "Olá, {01}{05}.\\nSou eu, {02}.\\n\\nEstá indo bem?\\n\\nAlguém me disse algo de você.\\nComo você ganhou {04} combates\\n\\nseguidos num lugar\\n\\nchamado {03}?\\n\\nIsso é difÍcil de conseguir.\\nAté mais!"},
  {"g3:082b02d9", "Ah, hello, {01}{05}!\\nThis is {02}!\\n\\nI hope you've been keeping well.\\n\\nThey say you won {04} straight\\nbattles at the {03}.\\n\\nI admire your energy!\\nBye now.", "Ah, olá, {01}{05}!\\nAqui é {02}!\\n\\nEspero que esteja indo bem.\\n\\nDizem que você venceu {04} combates seguidos lá no {03}.\\n\\nEu admiro sua energia!\\nAté logo."},
  {"g3:082b0366", "Oh, hi, {01}{05}.\\nThis is {02}.\\n\\nI heard about you!\\nDidn't you just win {04} battles in\\n\\na row at the {03}?\\n\\nYou're an inspiration!\\nBye-bye!", "Oh, oi, {01}{05}.\\nSou eu {02}.\\n\\nEu ouvi sobre você!\\nNÃo foi você que ganhou {04} combates\\n\\nseguidos no {03}?\\n\\nVocê é uma inspiraçÃo!\\nTchau!"},
  {"g3:082b03e6", "Hi! This is {02}.\\nI heard the news!\\n\\nThey say you did excellent at\\nthe {03}.\\n\\nIt's awesome--{04} straight wins?\\nSee you!", "Oi! Aqui é {02}.\\nOuvi as notÍcias!\\n\\nDizem que você foi excelente\\nna {03}.\\n\\nÉ incrÍvel--{04} combates seguidos?\\nAté logo!"},
  {"g3:082b0457", "Hello, it's {02}!\\nI heard about you!\\n\\nThey said you won {04} straight\\nbattles at the {03}.\\n\\nThat's special! I should try\\nharder, too! See you!", "Alô, é {02}!\\nEu ouvi sobre você!\\n\\nOuvir que você ganhou {04} combates\\nseguidos no {03}.\\n\\nIsso é tÃo especial! Eu devo\\né tentar mais! Até logo!"},
  {"g3:082b04de", "Hey there, {01}!\\nIt's me, {02}.\\n\\nI heard you went on a tear at\\nthe {03}!\\n\\nA big {04}-win streak...\\nThat is a big record, isn't it?\\n\\nI'd better get it together, too!\\nCatch you soon!", "Ei, {01}!\\nSou eu, {02}.\\n\\nOuvi dizer que você foi incrÍvel\\nna {03}!\\n\\nFantástico {04}-sequências de vitórias...\\nÉ um grande record, nÃo é?\\n\\nUau! É melhor eu tentar, também!\\nAté mais!"},
  {"g3:082b0586", "Hey, {01}{05}.\\n{02} here. What's up?\\n\\nThere's a rumor going around that\\nyou strung together {04} straight\\n\\nwins at the {03}.\\n\\nI'd better step it up, too.\\nSee you!", "Ei, {01}{05}.\\nSou eu {02}. O que houve?\\n\\nHá um boato de que você foi\\ncapar de conseguir {04} vitórias\\n\\nseguidas na {03}.\\n\\nÉ melhor eu melhorar, também.\\nAté mais!"},
  {"g3:082b061c", "Hiya, {01}{05}!\\nIt's {02}.\\n\\nYou were at the {03}\\nand won {04} battles in a row?\\n\\nIsn't that something!\\n\\nMe? I'd say I'm coming along.\\nSee you soon!", "Hiya, {01}{05}!\\nIt's {02}.\\n\\nYou were at the {03}\\nand won {04} battles in a row?\\n\\nIsn't that something!\\n\\nMe? I'd say I'm coming along.\\nSee you soon!"},
  {"g3:082b06a3", "Hey, {01}{05}.\\n{02} here. How are you?\\n\\nBy the way, I heard you pulled off\\nthe feat of {04} straight wins at\\n\\nthe {03}.\\n\\nI'd better try harder myself!\\nSee you soon!", "Ei, {01}{05}.\\nÉ {02} aqui. Como vai?\\n\\nQue bom, ouvi dizer que você teve\\na proeza de {04} vitórias seguidas\\n\\nno {03}.\\n\\nEu deveria me esforçar mais!\\nTe vejo em breve!"},
  {"g3:082b073b", "...Er, {01}{05}?\\n{02} here...\\n\\nOh, yeah, you were over at\\nthe {03}, right?\\n\\nAnd you won {04} battles in a row.\\n\\nOh, there goes a rare POKéMON!\\nI have to go!", "...Er, {01}{05}?\\n{02} here...\\n\\nOh, yeah, you were over at\\nthe {03}, right?\\n\\nAnd you won {04} battles in a row.\\n\\nOh, there goes a rare POKéMON!\\nI have to go!"},
  {"g3:082b07c7", "Oh, {01}{05}, how do you do?\\nThis is {02} speaking.\\n\\nI hope you're doing well.\\n\\nOh, but, you are. I've heard that\\nyou won {04} matches in a row at\\n\\nthe {03}.\\n\\nThat's very impressive!\\nI'd better work on my POKéMON, too!", "Oh, {01}{05}, como vai?\\nAqui é {02} falando.\\n\\nEspero que esteja bem.\\n\\nOh, mas, foi você? Eu ouvir que\\nvocê venceu {04} partidas seguidas\\n\\nlá na {03}.\\n\\nIsso é muito incrÍvel! E melhor eu\\ntreinar meus POKéMON, também!"},
