  {"g3:082b2456", "ROXANNE: Oh, hello, {01}!\\n\\nI've been hard at work retraining\\nsince we met.\\n\\nI will still need some more time\\nbefore I can reopen the GYM.\\n\\nBut when I do, please visit my GYM\\nfor a rematch!", "ROXANNE: Oh, olá, {01}!\\n\\nEu tenho treinado muito desde  \\na última vez.\\n\\nEu ainda preciso de mais tempo\\nantes de reabrir o GYM.\\n\\nQuando terminar, porfavor visite \\nmeu GYM para uma revanche!"},
  {"g3:082b250e", "ROXANNE: Is this {01}?\\nCongratulations!\\n\\nI've been hearing about you!\\n\\nAs for me, I need some more time\\nbefore I can reopen the GYM.\\n\\nBut when I do, please visit my GYM\\nfor a rematch!", "ROXANNE: {01}, é você?\\nParabéns!\\n\\nTodo mundo fala de você!\\n\\nQuanto a mim, vou precisar de\\ntempo para reabrir o GINÁSIO.\\n\\nMas, quando estiver pronto,\\nvenha me ver para lutar outra vez!"},
  {"g3:082b25c1", "ROXANNE: {01}!\\nMy GYM is ready!\\n\\nPlease visit RUSTBORO whenever\\nyou can!", "ROXANNE: {01}!\\nMeu GYM está pronto!\\n\\nEntÃo visite RUSTBORO\\nquando puder!"},
  {"g3:082b2607", "ROXANNE: At the RUSTBORO GYM,\\nthe fact that we battled, {01},\\n\\nis a matter of pride.", "ROXANNE: {01}, aqui no\\nGINÁSIO de RUSTBORO, lutar\\n\\né uma questÃo de orgulho."},
  {"g3:082b2659", "BRAWLY: Hey, there, {01}{05}!\\n\\nI learned a lot from the battle we\\nhad together.\\n\\nI intend to do my training over,\\nthen reopen the GYM.\\n\\nIt's going to take some time before\\nI'm ready to run the GYM again.\\n\\nBut if I can reopen the GYM,\\nI want you to challenge us again.", "BRAWLY: Ei, Oi, {01}{05}!\\n\\nEu aprendi muito com a batalha\\nque tivemos juntos.\\n\\nEu pretendo concluir o meu treino,\\nentÃo reabrir o GINÁSIO.\\n\\nVai demorar um tempo antes\\nde ficar pronto lutar de novo.\\n\\nMas se eu puder reabrir o GINÁSIO,\\neu quero o seu desafio novamente."},
  {"g3:082b275d", "BRAWLY: Hey, {01}{05}!\\nCongratulations!\\n\\nWord about your exploits arrived\\non tidal winds!\\n\\nIt appears as if I need to work on\\nmy training some more.\\n\\nIt's going to take some time before\\nI'm ready to run the GYM again.\\n\\nBut if I can reopen the GYM,\\nI want you to challenge us again.", "BRAWLY: Eh, {01}{05}!\\nMeus parabéns!\\n\\nNÃo para de chegar notÍcias sobre\\nseus êxitos!\\n\\nMe parece que para mim me faz\\nfalta treinar muito mais.\\n\\nPreciso de tempo para recuperar\\nas forças para abrir o GINÁSIO.\\n\\nMas, se consigo organizá-lo\\ntudo bem, eu gostaria lutar\\n\\ncontigo de novo."},
  {"g3:082b286f", "BRAWLY: Hey, {01}{05}!\\nMy GYM's ready for action!\\n\\nCome back to DEWFORD anytime\\nfor another challenge!", "BRAWLY: Ei, {01}{05}!\\nMeu GYM já está em açÃo!\\n\\nVenha a DEWFORD qualquer\\nhora para outro desafio!"},
  {"g3:082b28d1", "BRAWLY: {01}{05}, I don't think\\nI'll ever get bored of battling you!", "BRAWLY: {01}{05}, eu acho que nunca\\nme canso de lutar contra você!"},
  {"g3:082b2912", "WATTSON: Oh, it's you!\\n\\nAfter you left, I've been redoing\\nmy training from scratch.\\n\\nI'd say I could use a wee bit more\\ntime to reopen my GYM.\\n\\nYou'll have to wait till then!\\nWahahahaha!", "WATTSON:  Ah, é você!\\n\\nDepois que você saiu, fui refazer\\nmeu treinamento a partir do zero.\\n\\nEu diria que preciso de mais\\ntempo para reabrir o GYM.\\n\\nE você vai ter que esperar!\\nWahahaha!"},
  {"g3:082b29ca", "WATTSON: Wahahahaha!\\n\\nYou've really done it, haven't you?\\nI've been getting word about you!\\n\\nIt seems I need to retrain some\\nmore still.\\n\\nI'd say I could use a wee bit more\\ntime to reopen my GYM.\\n\\nYou'll have to wait till then!\\nWahahahaha!", "WATTSON: Wahahahaha!\\n\\nEstá incomparável, nÃo é mesmo?\\nEstá na boca de todos!\\n\\nEstou treinando muito, mas\\nacho que até me falta pouco.\\n\\nVou levar algum tempo antes\\nde continuar com o GINÁSIO.\\n\\nAssim que terminar tudo te aviso!\\nWahahahaha!"},
  {"g3:082b2ab6", "WATTSON: Oh, it's you!\\nMy GYM's ready!\\n\\nVisit MAUVILLE anytime!\\nWahahahaha!", "WATTSON: Oh, é você!\\nMeu GINÁSIO está pronto!\\n\\nVisite MAUVILLE qualquer hora!"},
  {"g3:082b2b01", "WATTSON: Wahahaha!\\n\\nA battle with you is always charged\\nwith shocking power!", "WATTSON: Wahahaha!\\n\\nUm combate com você é sempre\\ncarregado de muita energia!"},
  {"g3:082b2b4d", "FLANNERY: {01}...\\n\\nWhen we battled, I learned exactly\\nhow immature I was.\\n\\nBut I'm not done yet!\\n\\nI'm going to redo my training and\\nreopen the GYM.\\n\\nWhen the time comes, {01},\\nplease challenge us again.", "FLANNERY: {01}...\\n\\nQuando batalhamos, eu aprendi\\no quanto imaturo eu era.\\n\\nMas ainda nÃo estou pronta!\\n\\nVou refazer o meu treino\\ne reabrir o GINÁSIO.\\n\\nQuando chega a hora, {01},\\nvenha desafiar de novo."},
  {"g3:082b2c0e", "FLANNERY: Hello, {01}?\\nCongratulations!\\n\\nWord of your success has reached\\nus like the heat of a volcano!\\n\\nOur training is coming along very\\nwell here.\\n\\nWhen the GYM's ready, a mark will\\nappear beside my name in the\\n\\nMATCH CALL list.", "FLANNERY: Olá, {01}?\\nMeus parabéns!\\n\\nTodo mundo compara sua força\\ncomo um volcÃo em erupçÃo!\\n\\nPor aqui, tudo bem,\\nestou treinando muito.\\n\\nQuando o GINÁSIO estiver pronto\\naparecerá uma marca junto a meu\\n\\nnome em sua AGENDA."},
  {"g3:082b2cf1", "FLANNERY: Oh, {01}?\\nOur GYM's ready!\\n\\nCome to LAVARIDGE for a soak\\nin the hot spring and a challenge!", "FLANNERY: Oh, {01}?\\nO GYM está pronto!\\n\\nVenha em LAVARIDGE para relaxar\\nno termas, e ter um desafio!"},
  {"g3:082b2d54", "FLANNERY: {01}...\\nI'm positive that you keep getting\\n\\nbetter at training every time.", "FLANNERY: {01}...\\nTenho certeza que você fica\\n\\nmelhor nos treinos cada vez mais."},
  {"g3:082b2da4", "WINONA: Hello, {01}!\\n\\nThanks to our battle, I've come\\nto understand my weak points!\\n\\nWhen I reopen the GYM, I won't go\\ndown in defeat again!", "WINONA: Olá, {01}!\\n\\nGraças à nossa batalha, eu vim\\nentender os meus pontos fracos!\\n\\nQuando eu reabrir o GYM, eu nÃo vou\\nperder novamente!"},
  {"g3:082b2e2d", "WINONA: You've done it, {01}!\\n\\nNews about the new CHAMPION\\nhas reached us in FORTREE!\\n\\nBut... The next time we battle,\\nit's not going to end the same way.", "WINONA: Muito bem, {01}!\\n\\nAs notÍcias de sua vitória na LIGA\\nchegou voando até FORTREE!\\n\\nMas... na próxima vez que lutarmos,\\nnÃo acho que sairá tÃo bem..."},
  {"g3:082b2ec2", "WINONA: Is this {01}?\\nOur GYM is back in operation!\\n\\nWe're waiting for you in FORTREE!", "WINONA: É {01}?\\nMeu GYM está funcionando!\\n\\nEstamos esperando por você\\naqui em FORTREE!"},
  {"g3:082b2f16", "WINONA: {01}...\\nThough I have lost, my wings will\\n\\nnever break.\\n\\nYes, in exactly the same way that\\nyou never lost sight of your dream.", "WINONA: {01}...\\nApesar de ter perdido, minhas asas\\n\\nnunca quebra.\\n\\nSim, exatamente igual a você que\\nnunca perde de vista o seu sonho."},
  {"g3:082b2f97", "TATE: Oh! You're...\\nLIZA: {01}!\\n\\nTATE: We're in training again...\\nLIZA: So we can reopen our GYM!\\n\\nTATE: When our GYM is ready...\\nLIZA: When our GYM is ready...\\n\\nTATE: A mark'll appear by our name...\\nLIZA: On the MATCH CALL list.", "TATE: Oh! Você é...\\nLIZA: {01}!\\n\\nTATE: Estamos treinando de novo...\\nLIZA: Para reabrir o GINÁSIO!\\n\\nTATE: Quando estiver pronta...\\nLIZA: Quando estiver pronta...\\n\\nTATE: Aparecerá uma marca\\nno nosso nome...\\n\\nLIZA: Lá em sua AGENDA."},
  {"g3:082b306e", "TATE: {01}, congratulations!\\nLIZA: {01}, congratulations!\\n\\nTATE: The two of us are...\\nLIZA: Still in training!\\n\\nTATE: We need some more time, but...\\nLIZA: When our GYM is ready...\\n\\nTATE: A mark'll appear by our name...\\nLIZA: On the MATCH CALL list.", "TATE: {01}, parabéns!\\nLIZA: {01}, parabéns!\\n\\nTATE: Nós estamos...\\nLIZA: Nós estamos em treinamento!\\n\\nTATE: Mais ainda nos falta tempo...\\nLIZA: Quando estivermos prontas...\\n\\nTATE: Aparecerá uma marca junto\\na nosso nome...\\n\\nLIZA: Em sua AGENDA."},
  {"g3:082b3158", "TATE: {01}!\\nLIZA: {01}!\\n\\nTATE: Our GYM is ready!\\nLIZA: Our GYM is ready!\\n\\nTATE: Please come visit...\\nLIZA: MOSSDEEP anytime!", "TATE: {01}!\\nLIZA: {01}!\\n\\nTATE: Nosso GYM está pronto!\\nLIZA: Estamos prontas!\\n\\nTATE: Venha nos visitar...\\nLIZA: em MOSSDEEP!"},
  {"g3:082b31cd", "TATE: {01}, the battle we had...\\nLIZA: Is an invaluable experience.\\n\\nTATE: It would be nice if...\\nLIZA: We could all battle again!", "TATE: {01}, nós já batalhamos...\\nLIZA: Que experiência inestimável.\\n\\nTATE: Seria bom se...\\nLIZA: Pudessemos lutar novamente!"},
  {"g3:082b3249", "JUAN: Hmm...\\n{01}{05}... Was it?\\n\\nOur battle together--it brought\\nto me memories of when I first\\n\\nencountered WALLACE.\\n\\nPerhaps you are a genius who may\\nyet surpass WALLACE!", "JUAN: Hmm...\\nSe chama {01}{05}, nÃo é?\\n\\nNosso combate...\\nMe faz lembrar da primeira vez\\n\\nque enfrentei WALLACE.\\n\\nTalvez você seja o TREINADOR\\nque pode até superar WALLACE!"},
  {"g3:082b32ec", "JUAN: Fufu... {01}{05}...\\nYou've finally achieved your goal.\\n\\nMy eye for appraising talent wasn't\\nmistaken...\\n\\nI wish for another chance to meet\\nyou, for you have scaled the peak\\n\\nof power and prestige.", "JUAN: Hehe... {01}{05}...\\nFinalmente chegou onde queria.\\n\\nMeu olho para avaliar o talento\\nnÃo estava errado...\\n\\nLutaremos de novo. E está será\\numa possibilidade quero ver\\n\\no prestigio a quem se refere."},
  {"g3:082b33aa", "JUAN: Hoho... {01}{05}...\\n\\nOur SOOTOPOLIS GYM has finally\\nreopened.\\n\\nIf you wish to see me, you are\\nwelcome to visit anytime.", "JUAN: Hoho... {01}{05}...\\n\\nNosso GYM em SOOTOPOLIS\\nfinalmente reabriu.\\n\\nSe quer me ver, seja bem\\nvindo para a visita sempre."},
  {"g3:082b341e", "JUAN: {01}{05}...\\n\\nLike the finest music, the battles\\nwe wage together strike chords\\n\\nof inspiration in my heart...\\n\\nWhen I close my eyes, I see visions\\nof you soaring with the melody...", "JUAN: {01}{05}...\\n\\nComo uma bela música, nossos\\ncombates resultam em mim como\\n\\nauténtica fonte de inspiraçÃo...\\n\\nQuando fecho os olhos, te vejo\\ncompondo sua estratégia em\\n\\nbela melodia..."},
  {"g3:082b34cc", "SIDNEY: Yo, {01}!\\n\\nIf you want to battle with me\\nagain, you come on back whenever\\n\\nyou like to the POKéMON LEAGUE.\\n\\nI'll always be here!\\nI'll be waiting!", "SIDNEY: Eh, {01}!\\n\\nSe quer lutar comigo de novo,\\nvolte sempre quando quiser\\n\\naqui na LIGA POKéMON.\\n\\nDaqui eu nÃo me movo!\\nE aqui eu te espero!"},
  {"g3:082b3561", "PHOEBE: Hi, {01}!\\n\\nHow about coming back here again\\nsometime?\\n\\nI'd like to see how much tighter\\nyour bond has grown with your\\n\\nPOKéMON.", "PHOEBE: Olá, {01}!\\n\\nQue tal voltar aqui novamente\\nalgum dia?\\n\\nEu gostaria muito de ver\\ncomo tem estreitado o laço\\n\\ncom seus POKéMON."},
  {"g3:082b35e4", "GLACIA: Hello, {01}.\\n\\nI trust you haven't become\\ncomplacent with your power?\\n\\nIf you feel the need to cool your\\nhot emotions just a little, do come\\n\\nto the POKéMON LEAGUE...", "GLACIA: Olá, {01}.\\n\\nImagino que até queira\\naumentar a sua força.\\n\\nPois, se preferir, poderiamos\\nnos ver na LIGA POKéMON\\n\\npara temperar os ánimos um pouco..."},
  {"g3:082b368b", "DRAKE: That voice... {01}, is it?\\nYou sound well...\\n\\nI understand that there is now\\na facility called the BATTLE\\n\\nFRONTIER that tests the skills of\\n\\nTRAINERS.\\n\\nHowever, if you wish to have real\\nbattles, there is no substitute for\\n\\nthe POKéMON LEAGUE!\\n\\nDon't you agree, {01}?", "DRAKE: Sua voz me soa...\\nÉ {01}, nÃo é?\\n\\nMe parece muito alegre...\\n\\nEu entendo que há um lugar\\nchamado BATTLE FRONTIER\\n\\nem que se pode por a prova\\n\\nalguns TREINADORES.\\n\\nContudo, se quer combates\\nde verdade, nÃo há substituto\\n\\npara a LIGA POKéMON!\\n\\nVocê nÃo concorda, {01}?"},
  {"g3:082b3790", "WALLACE: Hello, {01}{05}.\\nHave you met STEVEN?\\n\\nHe is...\\nActually incredibly skilled.\\n\\nHowever, he's an odd soul who\\nrarely battles.\\n\\nInstead, he would rather look for\\nrare stones.\\n\\nI'm sure he's digging in a cave or\\na craggy mountain somewhere.\\n\\nBut what is a rare stone exactly?\\nAll I can think of is a METEORITE...", "WALLACE: Oi, {01}{05}.\\nTem visto STEVEN?\\n\\nEle é... Na verdade...\\nincrivelmente habilidoso.\\n\\nPorém, é uma alma estranha\\nque raramente luta.\\n\\nPrefere buscar pedras raras\\npor ai.\\n\\nÉ certo que está cavando\\nem alguma caverna ou numa\\n\\nmontanha escarpada.\\n\\nMas o que é uma pedra\\nrara, exatamente?\\n\\nComo nÃo seria um METEORITO..."},
  {"g3:082b3ab3", "MAY: Hi, {01}{05}!\\n\\nMR. BRINEY retired as a SAILOR,\\nbut I still see him out on the sea\\n\\nwith his pet PEEKO sometimes.\\n\\nHe must love the sea still.", "MAY: Oi, {01}{05}!\\n\\nSabia? MR. BRINEY aposentou-se, \\nmas ainda vejo no meio do mar\\n\\ncom o seu bichinho PEEKO às vezes.\\n\\nEle deve amar o mar ainda."},
  {"g3:082b3b3f", "MAY: Hi, {01}{05}!\\n\\nYou know how little towns like\\nPETALBURG and DEWFORD have GYMS?\\n\\nFor some reason, the big port of\\nSLATEPORT doesn't have a GYM.\\n\\nWhen they finally build a GYM there,\\nI should apply to be the LEADER.", "MAY: Oi, {01}{05}!\\n\\nVocê sabe que cidades pequenas como\\nPETALBURG e DEWFORD tem GYMS?\\n\\nPor alguma razÃo, o grande porto\\nde SLATEPORT nÃo tem GINÁSIO.\\n\\nSe um dia construir um GINÁSIO lá,\\neu deveria pedir para ser LÍDER."},
  {"g3:082b3c13", "MAY: Hi, {01}{05}!\\n\\nDo you remember a man named\\nthe CUTTER in RUSTBORO?\\n\\nHe had a house there, remember?\\n\\nWell, I found out his younger\\nbrother lives in MAUVILLE.\\n\\nCan you guess his name?\\n\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n\\nThe ROCK SMASH GUY!", "MAY: Oi, {01}{05}!\\n\\nVocê se lembra de um homem \\no SERRALHEIRO em RUSTBORO?\\n\\nEle tem uma casa lá, lembra?\\n\\nBem, eu descobri que seu irmÃo\\nmais novo vive em MAUVILLE.\\n\\nVocê nem imagina o nome dele?\\n\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n\\nÉ o HOMEM QUEBRA PEDRA!"},
  {"g3:082b3cf3", "MAY: {01}{05}?\\n\\nRUSTURF TUNNEL...\\nThey named it that because it\\n\\njoins RUSTBORO and VERDANTURF.", "MAY: {01}{05}?\\n\\nO TÚNEL RUSTURF...\\nEle é chamado assim porque\\n\\nliga RUSTBORO até VERDANTURF."},
  {"g3:082b3d4b", "MAY: {01}{05}, how are you?\\n\\nI'm out on ROUTE 111 now.\\n\\nI'm going to get a rest at an old\\nlady's house.\\n\\nShe lives just north of\\nthe desert.", "MAY: {01}{05}, como vai?\\n\\nEu estou saindo da ROUTE 111\\nagora.\\n\\nEu vou descansar um pouco\\nna POUSADA DA VOVÔ.\\n\\nEla vive ao norte do deserto."},
  {"g3:082b3dd1", "MAY: Hi, {01}{05}!\\n\\nDid you know about the MIRAGE\\nTOWER in the desert?\\n\\nThey say, like a mirage, it seems\\nto mysteriously come and go.\\n\\nI wish I could see it.", "MAY: Oi, {01}{05}!\\n\\nSerá que você sabe sobre a\\nTORRE MIRAGE no deserto?\\n\\nDizem que, parece misteriosamente\\nir e vir como miragem.\\n\\nEu gostaria de poder vê-la."},
  {"g3:082b3e69", "MAY: {01}{05}, yahoo!\\nI'm on ROUTE 119 now.\\n\\nThere's a big river here, and\\nit often rains.\\n\\nI got soaked!", "MAY: {01}{05}, Oba!\\nEu estou na ROTA 119 agora.\\n\\nHá um grande rio aqui,\\ne chove muito.\\n\\nEstou encharcada!"},
  {"g3:082b3ecd", "MAY: {01}{05}, hi.\\n\\nMT. PYRE is a memorial to POKéMON\\nwhose lives have ended.\\n\\nMaybe as a result, it's infested\\nwith many GHOST-type POKéMON!", "MAY: {01}{05}, oi.\\n\\nMT. PIRA é um memorial para POKéMON\\ncujas vidas tiveram um fim.\\n\\nO resultado disso, é infestada\\nde POKéMON tipo FANTASMA!"},
  {"g3:082b3f55", "MAY: Hi, {01}{05}!\\n\\nI was thinking of going to the hot\\nspring in LAVARIDGE.\\n\\nBut on the way, around JAGGED\\nPASS, I ran into some bad-looking\\n\\ncharacters. The mood was ugly!", "MAY: Oi, {01}{05}!\\n\\nEu estava pensando em ir para\\no termas em LAVARIDGE.\\n\\nMas no caminho do DESFILADEIRO,\\neu encontrei com uns tipos bem\\n\\nestranhos. O clima era feio lá!"},
  {"g3:082b3ffb", "MAY: Hi, {01}{05}!\\nDid you see the news?\\n\\nThey say CAPT. STERN discovered\\nthe SEAFLOOR CAVERN while on his\\n\\nsubmarine expedition.", "MAY: Hi, {01}{05}!\\nDid you see the news?\\n\\nThey say CAPT. STERN discovered\\nthe SEAFLOOR CAVERN while on his\\n\\nsubmarine expedition."},
  {"g3:082b4077", "MAY: Hi, {01}{05}!\\nDon't you think it's neat?\\n\\nEven if you don't have a boat,\\nyou can cross the sea using\\n\\na POKéMON's move.\\n\\nDid you know there's more?\\n\\nThere's a POKéMON move that lets\\nyou go to the bottom of the sea.", "MAY: Hi, {01}{05}!\\nDon't you think it's neat?\\n\\nEven if you don't have a boat,\\nyou can cross the sea using\\n\\na POKéMON's move.\\n\\nDid you know there's more?\\n\\nThere's a POKéMON move that lets\\nyou go to the bottom of the sea."},
  {"g3:082b414b", "MAY: Hi, {01}{05}!\\nHope things are okay!\\n\\nHave you been on the sea and\\nfound your way to the other side\\n\\nblocked?\\n\\nTry diving deep underwater and\\nfollowing trenches.\\n\\nWhen you get to the other side,\\ncome up to the surface. Easy!", "MAY: Oi, {01}{05}!\\nEspero que eseteja bem!\\n\\nQuando estava no mar, conseguiu\\npassar para o lado que estava\\n\\nbloqueado?\\n\\nTente um MERGULHO e siga\\npor debaixo d'água.\\n\\nQuando chegar ao outro lado,\\nvolte para a superfÍcie. É fácil!"},
  {"g3:082b4228", "MAY: Hi, {01}{05}!\\n\\nHow's it going?\\nAre you filling your POKéDEX?\\n\\nI heard a rumor that there are\\nsuper-ancient POKéMON out there.\\n\\nAnd there are three of them!\\n\\nI would love to see even one...", "MAY: Olá, {01}{05}!\\n\\nComo vai você?\\nEstá completando a sua POKéDEX?\\n\\nEu ouvi rumores de que há\\nPOKéMON ancestrais por ai.\\n\\nE que há 3 POKéMON ancestrais!\\n\\nPoxa...!\\nEu adoraria poder ver um!..."},
  {"g3:082b42e0", "MAY: {01}{05}!\\nI heard the rumors!\\n\\nYou beat the SOOTOPOLIS GYM\\nLEADER?\\n\\nThat means you don't have far\\nto go, do you?", "MAY: {01}{05}!\\nEu ouvi os rumores!\\n\\nVocê derrotou o LÍDER do\\nGYM de SOOTOPOLIS?\\n\\nIsso significa que\\nfalta pouco, nÃo?"},
  {"g3:082b4350", "MAY: There isn't a single TRAINER\\nleft in HOENN who doesn't know who\\n\\nyou are, {01}{05}!\\n\\nWhen I tell people that I'm friends\\nwith you, {01}{05}, they're all\\n\\nsurprised!", "MAY: Acho que nÃo há nenhum\\nTREINADOR em HOENN que nÃo\\n\\nsaiba quem tú é, {01}{05}!\\n\\nQuando eu digo as pessoas\\nque sou sua amiga, {01}{05},\\n\\ntodos ficam muito surpresos!"},
  {"g3:082b43ef", "BRENDAN: Hey, {01}!\\n\\nMR. BRINEY retired as a SAILOR,\\nbut I still see him out on the sea\\n\\nwith his pet PEEKO sometimes.\\n\\nI guess he must love\\nthe sea still.", "BRENDAN: Hey, {01}!\\n\\nMR. BRINEY retired as a SAILOR,\\nbut I still see him out on the sea\\n\\nwith his pet PEEKO sometimes.\\n\\nI guess he must love\\nthe sea still."},
  {"g3:082b4486", "BRENDAN: Hey, {01}!\\n\\nI don't get how little towns like\\nPETALBURG and DEWFORD have GYMS.\\n\\nI mean, not when the big port of\\nSLATEPORT doesn't have a GYM.\\n\\nWhen they finally build a GYM there,\\nI should apply to be the LEADER.", "BRENDAN: Hey, {01}!\\n\\nI don't get how little towns like\\nPETALBURG and DEWFORD have GYMS.\\n\\nI mean, not when the big port of\\nSLATEPORT doesn't have a GYM.\\n\\nWhen they finally build a GYM there,\\nI should apply to be the LEADER."},
  {"g3:082b4560", "BRENDAN: Yo, {01}!\\n\\nDo you remember a guy named\\nthe CUTTER in RUSTBORO?\\n\\nHe had a house there, right?\\n\\nWell, it turns out his little\\nbrother lives in MAUVILLE.\\n\\nCan you guess his name?\\n\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n\\nThe ROCK SMASH GUY!", "BRENDAN: Yo, {01}!\\n\\nDo you remember a guy named\\nthe CUTTER in RUSTBORO?\\n\\nHe had a house there, right?\\n\\nWell, it turns out his little\\nbrother lives in MAUVILLE.\\n\\nCan you guess his name?\\n\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n\\nThe ROCK SMASH GUY!"},
  {"g3:082b463f", "BRENDAN: This voice... {01}?\\n\\nThey gave RUSTURF TUNNEL its name\\nbecause it joins RUSTBORO and\\n\\nVERDANTURF.\\n\\nDid you know that?", "BRENDAN: This voice... {01}?\\n\\nThey gave RUSTURF TUNNEL its name\\nbecause it joins RUSTBORO and\\n\\nVERDANTURF.\\n\\nDid you know that?"},
  {"g3:082b46b7", "BRENDAN: {01}, what's up?\\n\\nHey, I'm out on ROUTE 111 now.\\n\\nI'm going to rest up at an old\\nlady's house north of the desert.\\n\\nIf you're in the area, you should\\nvisit her, too.", "BRENDAN: {01}, what's up?\\n\\nHey, I'm out on ROUTE 111 now.\\n\\nI'm going to rest up at an old\\nlady's house north of the desert.\\n\\nIf you're in the area, you should\\nvisit her, too."},
  {"g3:082b4761", "BRENDAN: Hey, {01}!\\n\\nDid you know about the MIRAGE\\nTOWER in the desert?\\n\\nThey say, like a mirage, it can be\\nseen only sometimes.\\n\\nI'd like to see that!", "BRENDAN: Hey, {01}!\\n\\nDid you know about the MIRAGE\\nTOWER in the desert?\\n\\nThey say, like a mirage, it can be\\nseen only sometimes.\\n\\nI'd like to see that!"},
  {"g3:082b47f4", "BRENDAN: Who's this? Oh, {01}?\\nGuess what? I'm on ROUTE 119 now.\\n\\nThere's a big river here, and\\nit rains all the time.\\n\\nI got soaked to the bone!", "BRENDAN: Who's this? Oh, {01}?\\nGuess what? I'm on ROUTE 119 now.\\n\\nThere's a big river here, and\\nit rains all the time.\\n\\nI got soaked to the bone!"},
  {"g3:082b4882", "BRENDAN: {01}!\\n\\nMT. PYRE is a memorial to POKéMON\\nwhose lives have ended.\\n\\nThat's probably why it's infested\\nwith many GHOST-type POKéMON!", "BRENDAN: {01}!\\n\\nMT. PYRE is a memorial to POKéMON\\nwhose lives have ended.\\n\\nThat's probably why it's infested\\nwith many GHOST-type POKéMON!"},
  {"g3:082b4909", "BRENDAN: Hey there, {01}.\\n\\nI was on my way back to the hot\\nspring in LAVARIDGE.\\n\\nBut around JAGGED PASS, I ran into\\nsome nasty-looking characters.\\n\\nThose creeps...\\nI think they were TEAM MAGMA.", "BRENDAN: Hey there, {01}.\\n\\nI was on my way back to the hot\\nspring in LAVARIDGE.\\n\\nBut around JAGGED PASS, I ran into\\nsome nasty-looking characters.\\n\\nThose creeps...\\nI think they were TEAM MAGMA."},
  {"g3:082b49c4", "BRENDAN: Hi, {01}!\\nDid you catch the news?\\n\\nThey say CAPT. STERN discovered\\nthe SEAFLOOR CAVERN while on his\\n\\nsubmarine expedition.", "BRENDAN: Hi, {01}!\\nDid you catch the news?\\n\\nThey say CAPT. STERN discovered\\nthe SEAFLOOR CAVERN while on his\\n\\nsubmarine expedition."},
  {"g3:082b4a44", "BRENDAN: Hey there, {01}!\\nDon't you think it's awesome?\\n\\nEven if you don't have a boat,\\nyou can cross the sea using\\n\\na POKéMON's move.\\n\\nAnd, there's a move that lets you\\ntravel to the bottom of the sea.\\n\\nMan, POKéMON can do anything!", "BRENDAN: Hey there, {01}!\\nDon't you think it's awesome?\\n\\nEven if you don't have a boat,\\nyou can cross the sea using\\n\\na POKéMON's move.\\n\\nAnd, there's a move that lets you\\ntravel to the bottom of the sea.\\n\\nMan, POKéMON can do anything!"},
  {"g3:082b4b28", "BRENDAN: Howdy, {01}!\\nHow are you holding up?\\n\\nEver found your way to the other\\nside blocked while on the sea?\\n\\nTry diving deep underwater and\\nfollowing trenches at the bottom.\\n\\nWhen you get to the other side,\\ncome up to the surface. Simple!", "BRENDAN: Howdy, {01}!\\nHow are you holding up?\\n\\nEver found your way to the other\\nside blocked while on the sea?\\n\\nTry diving deep underwater and\\nfollowing trenches at the bottom.\\n\\nWhen you get to the other side,\\ncome up to the surface. Simple!"},
  {"g3:082b4c15", "BRENDAN: Hey there, {01}!\\n\\nHow's it going? Filling up your\\nPOKéDEX successfully?\\n\\nI heard a rumor that there are\\nsuper-ancient POKéMON out there.\\n\\nAnd not just one--three!\\n\\nI'd love to catch even one...", "BRENDAN: E ai, {01}!\\n\\nComo vai você? Preencheu sua\\nPOKéDEX completamente?\\n\\nEu ouvi rumores de que há\\nPOKéMON ancestrais por ai.\\n\\nE nÃo é apenas 1 -- sÃo 3!\\n\\nQue legal...!\\nEu adoraria poder capturar um!..."},
  {"g3:082b4cd8", "BRENDAN: {01}!\\nI heard the rumors!\\n\\nYou beat the SOOTOPOLIS GYM\\nLEADER? Awesome!\\n\\nYou're getting awful close now!", "BRENDAN: {01}!\\nEu ouvi os rumores!\\n\\nVocê derrotou o LÍDER do GYM\\nde SOOTOPOLIS? IncrÍvel!\\n\\nAgora só falta pouco!"},
  {"g3:082b4d46", "BRENDAN: There isn't a TRAINER in\\nall of HOENN who doesn't know who\\n\\nyou are, {01}!\\n\\nWhen I tell people that I'm friends\\nwith you, {01}, they get pretty\\n\\nenvious!", "BRENDAN: There isn't a TRAINER in\\nall of HOENN who doesn't know who\\n\\nyou are, {01}!\\n\\nWhen I tell people that I'm friends\\nwith you, {01}, they get pretty\\n\\nenvious!"},
  {"g3:082b4de2", "WALLY: Oh, {01}!\\n\\nI've been getting healthier and\\nmore physically fit.\\n\\nI hope I can become a TRAINER like\\nyou soon, {01}!", "WALLY: Oh, {01}!\\n\\nI've been getting healthier and\\nmore physically fit.\\n\\nI hope I can become a TRAINER like\\nyou soon, {01}!"},
  {"g3:082b4e57", "WALLY: {01}, hello!\\n\\nAfter RUSTURF TUNNEL went\\nthrough, WANDA's been very happy!", "WALLY: {01}, oi!\\n\\nDepois que TÚNEL RUSTURF ficou\\npronto, WANDA está muito feliz!"},
  {"g3:082b4ea5", "WALLY: Oh, {01}!\\n\\nI... I left my uncle's place in\\nVERDANTURF without telling anyone.\\n\\nI wonder if he's furious with me...\\n\\n{01}, you understand how\\nI feel, don't you?", "WALLY: Oh, {01}!\\n\\nEu deixei a casa do meu tio\\nem VERDANTURF sem dizer\\n\\nnada a ninguém.\\n\\nSerá que ele está furioso\\ncomigo...\\n\\n{01}, você entende como\\nme sinto, nÃo é?"},
  {"g3:082b4f41", "WALLY: {01}?\\nIt's me, WALLY!\\n\\nThe world of TRAINERS is amazing!\\n\\nWhen I have my POKéMON with me,\\nall sorts of people say hi!\\n\\nIt's as if everyone's getting\\nconnected through POKéMON!", "WALLY: {01}?\\nSou eu, WALLY!\\n\\nO mundo de TREINADORES é incrÍvel!\\n\\nQuando eu tenho meu POKéMON comigo,\\ntodos os tipos de pessoas dizem oi!\\n\\nÉ como se todos ficam ligados\\npelos POKéMON!"},
  {"g3:082b4ff3", "WALLY: {01}? It's awesome!\\nThat RALTS we caught together?\\n\\nIt evolved, {01}!\\n\\nMaybe I'm talented...\\n\\nOh, but I shouldn't get a big head\\nlike that!\\n\\nAfter all, it's the POKéMON that\\nshould be praised!", "WALLY: {01}? Escuta!\\nVocê lembra do RALTS\\n\\nque capturamos?\\n\\nPois evoluiu, {01}!\\nQue lega isso...\\n\\nDeve ter sido por causa dos\\nmeus esforços?...\\n\\nDepois de tudo, é o POKéMON que\\neu sempre sonhei em ter!"},
  {"g3:082b50b1", "... ... ... ... ... ...\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n\\nWALLY appears to be out of\\nthe POKéNAV's service area...", "... ... ... ... ... ...\\n... ... ... ... ... ...\\n\\nParece que WALLY está em uma\\nárea em que nÃo há sinal..."},
  {"g3:082b5100", "WALLY: Oh, {01}!\\n\\nBefore I met you, I hardly ever\\nleft my house...\\n\\nBut now, I'm on an adventure with\\nmy very own POKéMON...\\n\\n{01}...\\nThank you...", "WALLY: Oi, {01}!\\n\\nAntes de te conhecer, nunca\\ndeixei a minha casa...\\n\\nÉ agora, vou numa aventura\\ncom meus próprios POKéMON...\\n\\n{01}...\\nObrigado..."},
}
